(774718, 85017, 19831, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good choice for the challenge. The shot seems awful dark, although I understand it was dark there. A couple ideas that might improve this: pull back and include more of the crowd, different cropping, try to catch more people silhouetted in the screens, try to get an angle that shows the band on stage.</td>', 'I think this is a good choice for the challenge. The shot seems awful dark, although I understand it was dark there. A couple ideas that might improve this: pull back and include more of the crowd, different cropping, try to catch more people silhouetted in the screens, try to get an angle that shows the band on stage.', '2004-06-23 02:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
