(774753, 85325, 12962, '<td valign="top">Well thought of ... did you drive many hours just to have this?  I like how you put the road snaking through your frame and also how you put the barricade in perspective by shooting far.  The repetitions (wall, lamp posts) also give this more ooomph.</td>', 'Well thought of ... did you drive many hours just to have this?  I like how you put the road snaking through your frame and also how you put the barricade in perspective by shooting far.  The repetitions (wall, lamp posts) also give this more ooomph.', '2004-06-23 02:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(774754, 84297, 17492, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping your headline was made up. Very unfortunate if not. Technical : good - very good. Headline : good. 8</td>', 'I''m hoping your headline was made up. Very unfortunate if not. Technical : good - very good. Headline : good. 8', '2004-06-23 02:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(774755, 84319, 17492, '<td valign="top">Good photo. Good headline. Nicely done. 8</td>', 'Good photo. Good headline. Nicely done. 8', '2004-06-23 02:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(774757, 85331, 19831, '<td valign="top">I like your idea. Good concept. I get a feel of being too "set up" though. I have nothing against set-ups, i do them myself, it just seems too obvious in this case. Maybe if the body were not laying so straight out and neat, you know, bend the legs or half twisted on side or something like that. Maybe some kind of broken something, or mess up the rug, or some sign of conflict. Of course, if this is real, and you happened to catch it, wow!, ignore what I said and send me a message "what was I thinking?" ... hehehe.</td>', 'I like your idea. Good concept. I get a feel of being too "set up" though. I have nothing against set-ups, i do them myself, it just seems too obvious in this case. Maybe if the body were not laying so straight out and neat, you know, bend the legs or half twisted on side or something like that. Maybe some kind of broken something, or mess up the rug, or some sign of conflict. Of course, if this is real, and you happened to catch it, wow!, ignore what I said and send me a message "what was I thinking?" ... hehehe.', '2004-06-23 02:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(774761, 85295, 17492, '<td valign="top">Good photo. Good headline. 7</td>', 'Good photo. Good headline. 7', '2004-06-23 02:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(774762, 85330, 12962, '<td valign="top">Funny.  Well captured and well seen.  You were lucky to be there.  I also like it that you placed your goose of interest off center (it should be goose btw, as geese is plural :-)). DOF is exquisite - the feathers - texture and pattern - are very clear.  Finally, I like the inclusion of the ducks ... for comparison (others may think it as distracting).</td>', 'Funny.  Well captured and well seen.  You were lucky to be there.  I also like it that you placed your goose of interest off center (it should be goose btw, as geese is plural :-)). DOF is exquisite - the feathers - texture and pattern - are very clear.  Finally, I like the inclusion of the ducks ... for comparison (others may think it as distracting).', '2004-06-23 02:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(774763, 85170, 19831, '<td valign="top">good shot. I think youv''e met the challenge nicely. I can envision seeing this on a paper.</td>', 'good shot. I think youv''e met the challenge nicely. I can envision seeing this on a paper.', '2004-06-23 02:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
