(774782, 84961, 19831, '<td valign="top">I like this image very much. very interesting perspective. i like the ropes or hoses or whatever they are meandering about. I think it meets the challenge nicely, but is very good even on it''s own. Like i said, i like it as is, however I''m wondering if framing the person towards an edge (rule of thirds) would make it even better?</td>', 'I like this image very much. very interesting perspective. i like the ropes or hoses or whatever they are meandering about. I think it meets the challenge nicely, but is very good even on it''s own. Like i said, i like it as is, however I''m wondering if framing the person towards an edge (rule of thirds) would make it even better?', '2004-06-23 03:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
