(775729, 84374, 19841, '<td valign="top">Not quite enough detail.  I''m not sure if this is grainy or our of focus, but it doesn''t work.   Otherwise, it''s a great idea.</td>', 'Not quite enough detail.  I''m not sure if this is grainy or our of focus, but it doesn''t work.   Otherwise, it''s a great idea.', '2004-06-23 10:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
