(775866, 85156, 22922, '<td valign="top">LUCKY.  You got to a crime scene, but your composition is poor here.  I would suggest either cropping the body out (the partial streetsign in the top corner is distracting and the feet are already cut off anyway) or next time choosing to move your focus to include only the cop and the body so both are fully visible.</td>', 'LUCKY.  You got to a crime scene, but your composition is poor here.  I would suggest either cropping the body out (the partial streetsign in the top corner is distracting and the feet are already cut off anyway) or next time choosing to move your focus to include only the cop and the body so both are fully visible.', '2004-06-23 12:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
