(776236, 85328, 7073, '<td valign="top">haha... wonderful!  I wish a sea lion would walk around in my backyard</td>', 'haha... wonderful!  I wish a sea lion would walk around in my backyard', '2004-06-23 15:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(776238, 85212, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good shot and headline for USA Today.Good work.</td>', 'Good shot and headline for USA Today.Good work.', '2004-06-23 15:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(776243, 85228, 7322, '<td valign="top">I would rephrase the headline, "Migrant Worker Rights: A forgotten Agenda?" <br/>A headline needs to be very direct and to the point. There are many kinds of immigrants and some are treated better than others. I have to assume this is a migrant worker because of your headline. <br/> <br/>I added the question mark because unless this is an editorial, there needs to be some objectivity. It is debatable that the rights of immigrants (or migrant workers) is a forgotten agenda. Journalism should not state opinion as fact.<br/> <br/>This is a really nice photo but it has more of a travel feel to me. There isn''t any real conflict evident. It just shows a man doing his job. He looks healthy and decently clothed so I''m not convinced he is suffering injustice. I''m not suggesting he isn''t--I''m just stating as an objective observer, given no other context, this photo doesn''t indicate that he isn''t well-paid for his efforts. His load looks heavy but that doesn''t really indicate much about the working conditions. If he were a small child, or a frail elderly person I would be more concerned that questionable ethics were involved. <br/> <br/>Leaving the challenge for a moment, I think there isn''t much wrong with this photo. I would like it much better in color. The vibrant colors of the peppers against the pale basket, the green fields, and  his warm brown skin would make this much more captivating.<br/></td>', 'I would rephrase the headline, "Migrant Worker Rights: A forgotten Agenda?" A headline needs to be very direct and to the point. There are many kinds of immigrants and some are treated better than others. I have to assume this is a migrant worker because of your headline.  I added the question mark because unless this is an editorial, there needs to be some objectivity. It is debatable that the rights of immigrants (or migrant workers) is a forgotten agenda. Journalism should not state opinion as fact. This is a really nice photo but it has more of a travel feel to me. There isn''t any real conflict evident. It just shows a man doing his job. He looks healthy and decently clothed so I''m not convinced he is suffering injustice. I''m not suggesting he isn''t--I''m just stating as an objective observer, given no other context, this photo doesn''t indicate that he isn''t well-paid for his efforts. His load looks heavy but that doesn''t really indicate much about the working conditions. If he were a small child, or a frail elderly person I would be more concerned that questionable ethics were involved.  Leaving the challenge for a moment, I think there isn''t much wrong with this photo. I would like it much better in color. The vibrant colors of the peppers against the pale basket, the green fields, and  his warm brown skin would make this much more captivating.', '2004-06-23 15:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(776245, 85283, 7322, '<td valign="top">This photo is far too abstract to be good photojournalism. In journalism, the emphasis is on clarity and informing a wide public. I just have to take your word for it that this photograph somehow involves trucks. I can''t tell what it is.</td>', 'This photo is far too abstract to be good photojournalism. In journalism, the emphasis is on clarity and informing a wide public. I just have to take your word for it that this photograph somehow involves trucks. I can''t tell what it is.', '2004-06-23 15:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(776249, 85049, 7322, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame that big white boat is in the background. It kind of detracts from what is otherwise an interesting scene. I would suggest a rephrasing of the headline, "Dragon Boat Racers Return To South Haven". <br/>The subject has relevence as a human interest or weekend section story.</td>', 'It''s a shame that big white boat is in the background. It kind of detracts from what is otherwise an interesting scene. I would suggest a rephrasing of the headline, "Dragon Boat Racers Return To South Haven". The subject has relevence as a human interest or weekend section story.', '2004-06-23 15:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(776254, 84618, 7322, '<td valign="top">This would be more effective if we could see crowds of onlookers watching the event instead of just those guys milling about in the background. They don''t appear to be paying attention. This isn''t the most exciting viewpoint. There is too much empty space in front of the tiny cars, effectively removing the viewer from the action.</td>', 'This would be more effective if we could see crowds of onlookers watching the event instead of just those guys milling about in the background. They don''t appear to be paying attention. This isn''t the most exciting viewpoint. There is too much empty space in front of the tiny cars, effectively removing the viewer from the action.', '2004-06-23 15:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(776264, 84656, 21478, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - although a little to "busy" for me - no real focus point (for my eyes - not in the picture). The wire (or whatever it is) at the bottom right is distracting as well.</td>', 'Nice shot - although a little to "busy" for me - no real focus point (for my eyes - not in the picture). The wire (or whatever it is) at the bottom right is distracting as well.', '2004-06-23 15:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(776267, 85270, 21478, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot - I would have cropped tighter on the man shouting above the teamsters for kerry sign.</td>', 'This is a nice shot - I would have cropped tighter on the man shouting above the teamsters for kerry sign.', '2004-06-23 15:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(776268, 85301, 21478, '<td valign="top">Great photo with obvious appeal for newsworthiness.</td>', 'Great photo with obvious appeal for newsworthiness.', '2004-06-23 15:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(776269, 85229, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo but the headline doesn''t suggest anything of journalistic relevence. Your headline needs an angle to lead the viewer into the story that the photo is illustrating. The words Straight Edge say nothing about the event or topic. What about Straight Edge? As a phrase it means nothing to most people.  I know what the straight edge movement is but you can''t assume that everyone does. The point of journalism is to inform a wider audience. <br/> <br/>Leaving behind the challenge topic, this is a good shot. I like the lighting and the capture of the main subject. I would like to see more of the audience then is shown here. The main subject is looking away from the viewer so the impact of his gesture is lessened quite a bit. Since we can''t see who the gesture is aimed at it loses even more relevence.</td>', 'This is a good photo but the headline doesn''t suggest anything of journalistic relevence. Your headline needs an angle to lead the viewer into the story that the photo is illustrating. The words Straight Edge say nothing about the event or topic. What about Straight Edge? As a phrase it means nothing to most people.  I know what the straight edge movement is but you can''t assume that everyone does. The point of journalism is to inform a wider audience.  Leaving behind the challenge topic, this is a good shot. I like the lighting and the capture of the main subject. I would like to see more of the audience then is shown here. The main subject is looking away from the viewer so the impact of his gesture is lessened quite a bit. Since we can''t see who the gesture is aimed at it loses even more relevence.', '2004-06-23 15:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(776271, 85263, 21478, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the fishing line across his face, and the dark shadows. I would also have asked the man at the back to move aside - his dark shadows detract (in my humble opinion) from the image. Good title and shot concept though.</td>', 'Too bad about the fishing line across his face, and the dark shadows. I would also have asked the man at the back to move aside - his dark shadows detract (in my humble opinion) from the image. Good title and shot concept though.', '2004-06-23 15:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(776273, 85304, 21478, '<td valign="top">Great shot exemplifying the excitement of winning. Good color and lighting (looks like later afternoon light to me). Also great depth of field.</td>', 'Great shot exemplifying the excitement of winning. Good color and lighting (looks like later afternoon light to me). Also great depth of field.', '2004-06-23 15:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(776277, 84944, 7322, '<td valign="top">This photo doesn''t support the headline (which BTW, should read ''...Begins...''not ''...Starts...''). Where''s the torch? Is it that thing in front of the guy? Is he carrying it or is he just an onlooker? Why is that camera in the shot? This phot is more about this guy''s reaction to something then anything else. It is too personal for the story it is meant to support.</td>', 'This photo doesn''t support the headline (which BTW, should read ''...Begins...''not ''...Starts...''). Where''s the torch? Is it that thing in front of the guy? Is he carrying it or is he just an onlooker? Why is that camera in the shot? This phot is more about this guy''s reaction to something then anything else. It is too personal for the story it is meant to support.', '2004-06-23 15:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(776279, 85180, 21478, '<td valign="top">Nice work. A narrower depth of field may have added more drama to this. Depth of field is controlled through apeture (f stops). A larger apeture would make the depth of field narrower, and focusing on the player closest to you would have blurred the background. Remember the field of sharpness extends about 1/3 in front of the focus point, and 2/3 behind the focus point. Good work.</td>', 'Nice work. A narrower depth of field may have added more drama to this. Depth of field is controlled through apeture (f stops). A larger apeture would make the depth of field narrower, and focusing on the player closest to you would have blurred the background. Remember the field of sharpness extends about 1/3 in front of the focus point, and 2/3 behind the focus point. Good work.', '2004-06-23 15:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(776280, 85214, 21478, '<td valign="top">Good use of depth of field, and nice tones in the black and white. Perhaps some smoke trailing would have added some more impact to this "discarded" cigarette. Also maybe slightly more of it in view would be easier to understand.</td>', 'Good use of depth of field, and nice tones in the black and white. Perhaps some smoke trailing would have added some more impact to this "discarded" cigarette. Also maybe slightly more of it in view would be easier to understand.', '2004-06-23 15:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(776283, 84618, 21478, '<td valign="top">You could tighten this shot up by cropping out a lot of the road, sky and cones etc to the left of the image - perhaps just car 68 and the tires behind it - we''d still "get" the concept. The people waiting, street signs etc. just detract from the image (in my humble opinion).</td>', 'You could tighten this shot up by cropping out a lot of the road, sky and cones etc to the left of the image - perhaps just car 68 and the tires behind it - we''d still "get" the concept. The people waiting, street signs etc. just detract from the image (in my humble opinion).', '2004-06-23 15:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(776285, 84915, 21478, '<td valign="top">This is a good news shot - although a little blurry for me. Moving the computer closer to the edge of the desk, removing some of the clutter would also have added to the clarity of this image. I would also have liked to see the ladies faces - perhaps the shot over the monitor, or one of them looking at the camera.</td>', 'This is a good news shot - although a little blurry for me. Moving the computer closer to the edge of the desk, removing some of the clutter would also have added to the clarity of this image. I would also have liked to see the ladies faces - perhaps the shot over the monitor, or one of them looking at the camera.', '2004-06-23 15:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(776291, 84944, 21478, '<td valign="top">Not the best capture of an expression! And you cropped out the critical part of the olympic flame! A higher shot including the flame would have been much more dramatic, and possibly a narrower depth of field - the background is distracting. (Depth of field is controlled through apeture - try a larger apeture like f2 or f4 next time - and let the camera adjust the shutter speed accordingly. most cameras let you do this in AV (apeture priority) mode).</td>', 'Not the best capture of an expression! And you cropped out the critical part of the olympic flame! A higher shot including the flame would have been much more dramatic, and possibly a narrower depth of field - the background is distracting. (Depth of field is controlled through apeture - try a larger apeture like f2 or f4 next time - and let the camera adjust the shutter speed accordingly. most cameras let you do this in AV (apeture priority) mode).', '2004-06-23 16:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(776295, 85319, 10848, '<td valign="top">Veru pretty shot, very well executed I like it :) 9</td>', 'Veru pretty shot, very well executed I like it :) 9', '2004-06-23 16:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(776296, 85159, 21478, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - with good lighting (the shadow spillting the words is nice). I also like the humor (I suspect and hope) in the title!</td>', 'Nice shot - with good lighting (the shadow spillting the words is nice). I also like the humor (I suspect and hope) in the title!', '2004-06-23 16:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(776297, 85304, 10848, '<td valign="top">Very good shot, great capture of emotions. 10</td>', 'Very good shot, great capture of emotions. 10', '2004-06-23 16:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(776299, 85005, 21478, '<td valign="top">Wow - very cool - does it fly? I don''t know if you could reposition yourself for the shot - but from the front - with a little space for the truck to "move into" would have given this more a motion feel.</td>', 'Wow - very cool - does it fly? I don''t know if you could reposition yourself for the shot - but from the front - with a little space for the truck to "move into" would have given this more a motion feel.', '2004-06-23 16:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(776302, 85289, 21478, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot - but I think it would be difficult to view in newspaper style print. The color seems a little dark.</td>', 'Interesting shot - but I think it would be difficult to view in newspaper style print. The color seems a little dark.', '2004-06-23 16:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(776304, 85025, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is not really a photojournalistic type of photo. It doesn''t show a timely event, just a random deflated soccer ball that could be found in any back yard. Subtlety isn''t effective in photojournalism which is meant to inform a wide public. <br/> <br/>I find this composition rather mundane.  The colors are drab and the lighting on the ball is flat. The ball just isn''t a compelling enough subject.</td>', 'This is not really a photojournalistic type of photo. It doesn''t show a timely event, just a random deflated soccer ball that could be found in any back yard. Subtlety isn''t effective in photojournalism which is meant to inform a wide public.  I find this composition rather mundane.  The colors are drab and the lighting on the ball is flat. The ball just isn''t a compelling enough subject.', '2004-06-23 16:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(776305, 85290, 21478, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop on the girls - and perhaps from behind with the crowd would give me more information about this. Also - I don''t see any flags representing independance day.</td>', 'A tighter crop on the girls - and perhaps from behind with the crowd would give me more information about this. Also - I don''t see any flags representing independance day.', '2004-06-23 16:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(776306, 84749, 21478, '<td valign="top">This is tough - because I suspect people would prefer a tighter closeup of the president than all this - it seems to busy to be "reflecting" or "mourning". Also - the angle is a little distracting. Good concept though.</td>', 'This is tough - because I suspect people would prefer a tighter closeup of the president than all this - it seems to busy to be "reflecting" or "mourning". Also - the angle is a little distracting. Good concept though.', '2004-06-23 16:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(776308, 85251, 10848, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture, great colors, very effective shot. 8</td>', 'Wonderful capture, great colors, very effective shot. 8', '2004-06-23 16:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(776309, 85067, 21478, '<td valign="top">This is cool and clever - and a tighter crop would have added to it - we don''t need all that water at the bottom of the image, and you probably could have cropped out the far left and right people (they''re not making any hand signs either).</td>', 'This is cool and clever - and a tighter crop would have added to it - we don''t need all that water at the bottom of the image, and you probably could have cropped out the far left and right people (they''re not making any hand signs either).', '2004-06-23 16:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(776310, 85287, 21478, '<td valign="top">I think a close up of the window frame or door and inside would have been more "powerful" for the title. This is quite a busy photo and really just makes the house look old and dilapidated - not "just burnt down!".</td>', 'I think a close up of the window frame or door and inside would have been more "powerful" for the title. This is quite a busy photo and really just makes the house look old and dilapidated - not "just burnt down!".', '2004-06-23 16:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(776312, 85031, 21478, '<td valign="top">A little dark, and not close enough. You don''t need the dark space above and below. If you had gotten a closed fist in front of the flag - that would have been more powerful.</td>', 'A little dark, and not close enough. You don''t need the dark space above and below. If you had gotten a closed fist in front of the flag - that would have been more powerful.', '2004-06-23 16:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(776316, 84704, 7322, '<td valign="top">That isn''t really a headline. Why would the news reading public care to read a story about a firefighter watching a bonfire? You are simply describing what is evident to the viewer from the photo. The headline should clue the viewer in to the events of the story assuming there is one.<br/> <br/>Quibbles about the headline aside, the photo does have some journalistic merit although I can''t help feeling that in spite of the blaze, there isn''t a real sense of immediacy here. Maybe it''s a human interest story rather than a news story? The firefighter''s pose looks casual an unhurried. He doesn''t appear to think anything of significance is happening. In the end, this is kind of a cool sillouhette of a firefighter watching a bonfire. If your headline suggested an actual event this might work better as journalism.</td>', 'That isn''t really a headline. Why would the news reading public care to read a story about a firefighter watching a bonfire? You are simply describing what is evident to the viewer from the photo. The headline should clue the viewer in to the events of the story assuming there is one. Quibbles about the headline aside, the photo does have some journalistic merit although I can''t help feeling that in spite of the blaze, there isn''t a real sense of immediacy here. Maybe it''s a human interest story rather than a news story? The firefighter''s pose looks casual an unhurried. He doesn''t appear to think anything of significance is happening. In the end, this is kind of a cool sillouhette of a firefighter watching a bonfire. If your headline suggested an actual event this might work better as journalism.', '2004-06-23 16:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(776317, 85213, 21478, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! You could crop a little tighter - don''t need all the space on the right.</td>', 'Nice capture! You could crop a little tighter - don''t need all the space on the right.', '2004-06-23 16:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(776321, 85327, 8005, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s a really big building! Very good headline. Nice clean photo.9</td>', 'Wow, that''s a really big building! Very good headline. Nice clean photo.9', '2004-06-23 16:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(776326, 85019, 7322, '<td valign="top">What flag is this? Where is this?  It has a certain amount of relevence if you are referring to Ronald Reagan who just died (if you are than why not say his name?). But what is newsworthy about the fact that the flags are still at half-mast?  If the headline stated, "Flags Fly at Half-Mast in Honor of..." it would suggest an immediate event, as if the story were informing the public for the first time.  But since you''ve used the word ''still''  there really isn''t any story. <br/> <br/>Photographically, it is not too successful. The visual elements appear jammed together due to overtight cropping combined with deep DOF (you have everything in sharp focus). It lacks a human element to evoke any kind of emotion from a viewer who has no ties to this flag (such as myself) or building. The bit of tree in the edge of the frame is just clutter.</td>', 'What flag is this? Where is this?  It has a certain amount of relevence if you are referring to Ronald Reagan who just died (if you are than why not say his name?). But what is newsworthy about the fact that the flags are still at half-mast?  If the headline stated, "Flags Fly at Half-Mast in Honor of..." it would suggest an immediate event, as if the story were informing the public for the first time.  But since you''ve used the word ''still''  there really isn''t any story.  Photographically, it is not too successful. The visual elements appear jammed together due to overtight cropping combined with deep DOF (you have everything in sharp focus). It lacks a human element to evoke any kind of emotion from a viewer who has no ties to this flag (such as myself) or building. The bit of tree in the edge of the frame is just clutter.', '2004-06-23 16:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(776329, 84691, 21362, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped out that head (?) in the foreground. Otherwise, good photo.</td>', 'I would have cropped out that head (?) in the foreground. Otherwise, good photo.', '2004-06-23 16:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(776333, 84850, 7322, '<td valign="top">I find no journalistic relevence in this photo. Journalism is about facts not fancy. The lion is in fact just sitting there, as it is inanimate objects are inclined to do.  A news story is meant to inform a wide public of an event or issue. What is this informing us of?  In regards to the challenge, this doesn''t  work for me.<br/> <br/>This point of view hurts the composition since you get to much distortion of perspective in the columns. The column leaning in at the right edge suggest that not a lot of care went into the composition. Either show the whole thing or crop it out but it is usually best not to have partial elements leading the viewers eye to the edge of the frame with no real reward. This suggests to me that a vertical format might have worked better to bring focus to the lion.</td>', 'I find no journalistic relevence in this photo. Journalism is about facts not fancy. The lion is in fact just sitting there, as it is inanimate objects are inclined to do.  A news story is meant to inform a wide public of an event or issue. What is this informing us of?  In regards to the challenge, this doesn''t  work for me. This point of view hurts the composition since you get to much distortion of perspective in the columns. The column leaning in at the right edge suggest that not a lot of care went into the composition. Either show the whole thing or crop it out but it is usually best not to have partial elements leading the viewers eye to the edge of the frame with no real reward. This suggests to me that a vertical format might have worked better to bring focus to the lion.', '2004-06-23 16:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(776335, 85304, 21362, '<td valign="top">The picture and title don''t seem to agree. My first thought was that this was taken during a fight -- the raised fist seems angry, and the other two look like they might be arguing. I''m sure they were shouting and fist pumping in celebration, but it isn''t communicated well.  I probably would have chose a different title for the image, or a different image for the title. <br/> <br/>But more specific to the image, the shadow on one of the subject''s face is distracting. Nice color, sharpness, and use of DOF.</td>', 'The picture and title don''t seem to agree. My first thought was that this was taken during a fight -- the raised fist seems angry, and the other two look like they might be arguing. I''m sure they were shouting and fist pumping in celebration, but it isn''t communicated well.  I probably would have chose a different title for the image, or a different image for the title.  But more specific to the image, the shadow on one of the subject''s face is distracting. Nice color, sharpness, and use of DOF.', '2004-06-23 16:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(776339, 85318, 21478, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing people complain of the graininess, but I did the same. Nice shot with good panning (and I know how tought that is - great work!)</td>', 'I''m guessing people complain of the graininess, but I did the same. Nice shot with good panning (and I know how tought that is - great work!)', '2004-06-23 16:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(776340, 85275, 21478, '<td valign="top">Good balance in the shot using the leading lines.</td>', 'Good balance in the shot using the leading lines.', '2004-06-23 16:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(776341, 84646, 21478, '<td valign="top">Great title - I would have cropped the right side a little more - the guy holding the jackets seems not really in the picture anyway.</td>', 'Great title - I would have cropped the right side a little more - the guy holding the jackets seems not really in the picture anyway.', '2004-06-23 16:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(776343, 85214, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is far to abstract for journalism. Journalism (ideally) requires clarity in order to inform a wide public. I would argue that even if it were a beautifuly focused shot of the ashtray and smouldering butt that it would lack relevance to the story without a human element. Still lifes do not make good journalism. So in that respect I would say that it fails to meet the challenge.<br/> <br/>From a strictly photographic POV, I find the depth of field far to shallow to really draw me in. The tiny bit of in-focus subject is unappealing to me and as an abstract there aren''t really any dramatic or beautiful shapes, forms, lines, or colors created by the blurring.</td>', 'This is far to abstract for journalism. Journalism (ideally) requires clarity in order to inform a wide public. I would argue that even if it were a beautifuly focused shot of the ashtray and smouldering butt that it would lack relevance to the story without a human element. Still lifes do not make good journalism. So in that respect I would say that it fails to meet the challenge. From a strictly photographic POV, I find the depth of field far to shallow to really draw me in. The tiny bit of in-focus subject is unappealing to me and as an abstract there aren''t really any dramatic or beautiful shapes, forms, lines, or colors created by the blurring.', '2004-06-23 16:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(776344, 85199, 21478, '<td valign="top">the black and white make it difficult to distinguish the gas bowser from the card (perhaps could use a wash!). I also would look for prices in the image (with your title).</td>', 'the black and white make it difficult to distinguish the gas bowser from the card (perhaps could use a wash!). I also would look for prices in the image (with your title).', '2004-06-23 16:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
