(776367, 85175, 21478, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop without the teenage girl on the left and body on the right would have made this more impactful. In fact, you could probably get rid of the statue the kid isn''t touching. A little more light (perhaps fill flash) would also have revealed a bit more of the details in the statues face shadows.</td>', 'A tighter crop without the teenage girl on the left and body on the right would have made this more impactful. In fact, you could probably get rid of the statue the kid isn''t touching. A little more light (perhaps fill flash) would also have revealed a bit more of the details in the statues face shadows.', '2004-06-23 16:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
