(776676, 84749, 16488, '<td valign="top">This is a newsy item, but I think your photo tells rather than shows.  Perhaps if you''d included interested bookstore customers or an individual reacting to the display.  As is, it simply documents a store display.  Vertical lines need to be straightened and the inclusion of the angled side of the bookshelf gives the feeling that it might fall over.</td>', 'This is a newsy item, but I think your photo tells rather than shows.  Perhaps if you''d included interested bookstore customers or an individual reacting to the display.  As is, it simply documents a store display.  Vertical lines need to be straightened and the inclusion of the angled side of the bookshelf gives the feeling that it might fall over.', '2004-06-23 18:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
