(776736, 84910, 14043, '<td valign="top">This goes in order of what I notice first:<br/>1) (Doesn''t affect score) Star Wars reference, nice...<br/>2) Good use of thirds, but for a newspaper article, do you think they would have left that much space unused?  It would have been cropped to a couple of the "clones" to make a clear point.<br/>3) It seems too fuzzy, I don''t know what from, but it just doesn''t look sharpened enough.<br/>4) (this has no affect on the score) Is that a harbor or something flipped upside down??<br/>Score: 4</td>', 'This goes in order of what I notice first:1) (Doesn''t affect score) Star Wars reference, nice...2) Good use of thirds, but for a newspaper article, do you think they would have left that much space unused?  It would have been cropped to a couple of the "clones" to make a clear point.3) It seems too fuzzy, I don''t know what from, but it just doesn''t look sharpened enough.4) (this has no affect on the score) Is that a harbor or something flipped upside down??Score: 4', '2004-06-23 19:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(776737, 84585, 23104, '<td valign="top">awesome picture, though i dont know how well it will do here.</td>', 'awesome picture, though i dont know how well it will do here.', '2004-06-23 19:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(776739, 84618, 14043, '<td valign="top">This goes in order of what I notice first:<br/>1) Crop to the action!  I want to see just one car or one and the other behind it so that I know what is going on from the picture!  (Newspaper challenge or not, it''s too unfocused/not specific enough.)<br/>2) I can''t even see the lead car that well because it''s black against black...<br/>3) Good color otherwise.<br/>4) Good sharpness.<br/>Score: 4</td>', 'This goes in order of what I notice first:1) Crop to the action!  I want to see just one car or one and the other behind it so that I know what is going on from the picture!  (Newspaper challenge or not, it''s too unfocused/not specific enough.)2) I can''t even see the lead car that well because it''s black against black...3) Good color otherwise.4) Good sharpness.Score: 4', '2004-06-23 19:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
