(776751, 85007, 14043, '<td valign="top">This goes in order of what I notice first:<br/>1) Okay cropping, get rid of the bit of her upper arm that is showing and the glass at the bottom, make the cake piece and their hands central in the frame to bring attetion to them.<br/>2) The cake is blown out and it is distracting.<br/>3) Overall good idea and title, the purple tablecloth adds some nice color, as does the green behind them.<br/>Score: 5</td>', 'This goes in order of what I notice first:1) Okay cropping, get rid of the bit of her upper arm that is showing and the glass at the bottom, make the cake piece and their hands central in the frame to bring attetion to them.2) The cake is blown out and it is distracting.3) Overall good idea and title, the purple tablecloth adds some nice color, as does the green behind them.Score: 5', '2004-06-23 19:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(776754, 84429, 23104, '<td valign="top">hmm, i like this image a great deal, but it is not really the kind of photograph that would appear in a newspaper, much less with this headline. i really like the black background, an excellent photograph.</td>', 'hmm, i like this image a great deal, but it is not really the kind of photograph that would appear in a newspaper, much less with this headline. i really like the black background, an excellent photograph.', '2004-06-23 19:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
