(776767, 85331, 17485, '<td valign="top">For some reason this shot makes me laugh.</td>', 'For some reason this shot makes me laugh.', '2004-06-23 19:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(776771, 85191, 14043, '<td valign="top">This goes in order of what I notice first:<br/>1) Good title (except for spelling, which I''m sure you''ve heard about already, just so you know, I read right over it the first couple of times), I like how you connected to current events.<br/>2) Could you crop a little closer?  It would give more detail to it all.<br/>3) Up the contrast perhaps to give some detail to the plane, what''s the sign on it''s tail, is that it''s other wing on the bottom or a fin?  :)  The sky overpowers everything else too much.<br/>Score: 5</td>', 'This goes in order of what I notice first:1) Good title (except for spelling, which I''m sure you''ve heard about already, just so you know, I read right over it the first couple of times), I like how you connected to current events.2) Could you crop a little closer?  It would give more detail to it all.3) Up the contrast perhaps to give some detail to the plane, what''s the sign on it''s tail, is that it''s other wing on the bottom or a fin?  :)  The sky overpowers everything else too much.Score: 5', '2004-06-23 19:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
