(776775, 84551, 14043, '<td valign="top">This goes in order of what I notice first:<br/>1) Title needs to have a bit of closure, no dropping off a thought for a newspaper article. What does the title have to do with the photo?  I know it''s of factories and oil stuff, but closing out the title will tell me what I need to see in the picture.  <br/>2) The picture needs a focus point.  Crop.<br/>Score: 4</td>', 'This goes in order of what I notice first:1) Title needs to have a bit of closure, no dropping off a thought for a newspaper article. What does the title have to do with the photo?  I know it''s of factories and oil stuff, but closing out the title will tell me what I need to see in the picture.  2) The picture needs a focus point.  Crop.Score: 4', '2004-06-23 19:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(776776, 84757, 18925, '<td valign="top">its a strong image,but i feel it could have been stronger with a better title.</td>', 'its a strong image,but i feel it could have been stronger with a better title.', '2004-06-23 19:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(776777, 84457, 23279, '<td valign="top">Great action shot.   Perfect headline for newspaper.  Good luck.</td>', 'Great action shot.   Perfect headline for newspaper.  Good luck.', '2004-06-23 19:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(776779, 85075, 17485, '<td valign="top">The light on the right side of his nose is very distracting as is the suns reflection in the water.  The light being reflected back to the subject is too intense and obviously making him squint.  Other than that, this is an excellent photo with great clarity on the subject.</td>', 'The light on the right side of his nose is very distracting as is the suns reflection in the water.  The light being reflected back to the subject is too intense and obviously making him squint.  Other than that, this is an excellent photo with great clarity on the subject.', '2004-06-23 19:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(776782, 85248, 14043, '<td valign="top">This goes in order of what I notice first:<br/>1) Sounds like a human interest story...where''s the human?  Oh yeah...there.  Crop to the mother and child, let me see the expressions on their faces, I don''t care what the home looks like, I care about the people.<br/>2) I like how the little boy is looking at the camera, but...I can''t really tell what his face says, if it were cropped to him and his mother, then it''d be a powerful photo.<br/>3) Too much clutter.  Is it supposed to represent that they were kicked out?  Doesn''t work...The basketball hoop especially is distracting.<br/>Score: 5</td>', 'This goes in order of what I notice first:1) Sounds like a human interest story...where''s the human?  Oh yeah...there.  Crop to the mother and child, let me see the expressions on their faces, I don''t care what the home looks like, I care about the people.2) I like how the little boy is looking at the camera, but...I can''t really tell what his face says, if it were cropped to him and his mother, then it''d be a powerful photo.3) Too much clutter.  Is it supposed to represent that they were kicked out?  Doesn''t work...The basketball hoop especially is distracting.Score: 5', '2004-06-23 19:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
