(776805, 85229, 15648, '<td valign="top">Great Shot. I am real found of Musician pictures. This really show intensity of the singer. 10 <br/>If you are interested, check out my webshots web page, I have several rock pictures. I think you will like them. Go to www.webshots.com. Do a search under LEGATOMUZIC. It is my user name</td>', 'Great Shot. I am real found of Musician pictures. This really show intensity of the singer. 10 If you are interested, check out my webshots web page, I have several rock pictures. I think you will like them. Go to www.webshots.com. Do a search under LEGATOMUZIC. It is my user name', '2004-06-23 20:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(776806, 84521, 14043, '<td valign="top">This goes in order of what I notice first:<br/>1) Would this appear in a newspaper? - Yes.  I like how the title connects directly with the photo.<br/>2) Composition - Good close crop, brings my focus directly to the action.<br/>3) Lighting - The backlight unfortunately puts his face into shadow, sadly, unless this was posed, there''s nothing you can do about it during a sports game. <br/>4) Great capture of motion.<br/>Score: 6</td>', 'This goes in order of what I notice first:1) Would this appear in a newspaper? - Yes.  I like how the title connects directly with the photo.2) Composition - Good close crop, brings my focus directly to the action.3) Lighting - The backlight unfortunately puts his face into shadow, sadly, unless this was posed, there''s nothing you can do about it during a sports game. 4) Great capture of motion.Score: 6', '2004-06-23 20:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(776808, 85292, 14043, '<td valign="top">This goes in order of what I notice first:<br/>1) Um...what?  The angle makes it too hard to notice what is on the sign right away, let alone read it.<br/>2) Good DOF, but the background is still distracting because of the variedness.<br/>3) Great colors, I like the vividness.<br/>Score: 5</td>', 'This goes in order of what I notice first:1) Um...what?  The angle makes it too hard to notice what is on the sign right away, let alone read it.2) Good DOF, but the background is still distracting because of the variedness.3) Great colors, I like the vividness.Score: 5', '2004-06-23 20:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(776810, 85170, 22990, '<td valign="top">A very poignant image. Excellent choice of focal length. The lamp-post just behind it is a little distracting, but the image is still great. My favourite of the challenge.</td>', 'A very poignant image. Excellent choice of focal length. The lamp-post just behind it is a little distracting, but the image is still great. My favourite of the challenge.', '2004-06-23 20:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
