(776812, 85279, 14043, '<td valign="top">This goes in order of what I notice first:<br/>1) Random limb!  Eeek, that''s bad... and the tip of the horses nose is cut off...<br/>2) Great great idea.<br/>3) Try some contrast to add some deeper color to the horse and it''s rider, it seems too pale. <br/>4) Great expressions on both horse and rider, if the arm weren''t there and the color were a bit better, this would be scoring higher, but sadly it hurts it.<br/>Score: 7</td>', 'This goes in order of what I notice first:1) Random limb!  Eeek, that''s bad... and the tip of the horses nose is cut off...2) Great great idea.3) Try some contrast to add some deeper color to the horse and it''s rider, it seems too pale. 4) Great expressions on both horse and rider, if the arm weren''t there and the color were a bit better, this would be scoring higher, but sadly it hurts it.Score: 7', '2004-06-23 20:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(776813, 84635, 14043, '<td valign="top">This goes in order of what I notice first:<br/>1) Wonderful.<br/>2) Maybe a bit tighter crop on top but there''s nothing else I can say.<br/>Score: 10</td>', 'This goes in order of what I notice first:1) Wonderful.2) Maybe a bit tighter crop on top but there''s nothing else I can say.Score: 10', '2004-06-23 20:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
