(776824, 85023, 22990, '<td valign="top">Nice image. You managed to get it without blowing out the sky, which is great. I like the soft colours. The little blotch in the middle of the road and the shadow to the left are a little distracting, but those''re the only bad points to the image.</td>', 'Nice image. You managed to get it without blowing out the sky, which is great. I like the soft colours. The little blotch in the middle of the road and the shadow to the left are a little distracting, but those''re the only bad points to the image.', '2004-06-23 20:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
