(776900, 85336, 10390, '<td valign="top">You should have cropped out most of the road up to the tyres of the pickup at the bottom. Also I think you would have got a better shot from the other side.</td>', 'You should have cropped out most of the road up to the tyres of the pickup at the bottom. Also I think you would have got a better shot from the other side.', '2004-06-23 21:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
