(777024, 85248, 23131, '<td valign="top">The photo itself is very striking, but the caption detracts from it. It''s a newspaper heading, so "Sad But True Story" is redundant; if it weren''t true. Why would it be in a newspaper?<br/> <br/>Regardless, the photo did grab me. Especially the child. Great work!</td>', 'The photo itself is very striking, but the caption detracts from it. It''s a newspaper heading, so "Sad But True Story" is redundant; if it weren''t true. Why would it be in a newspaper? Regardless, the photo did grab me. Especially the child. Great work!', '2004-06-23 22:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
