(777134, 85155, 19831, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of your shot. I feel a little conflicted because I really like the shadows you''ve captured with this light/time of day, but that same light seems over exposed/burnt out in the center. Perhaps you could have waited a little or taken just a little sooner, depending on if it is morning or evening. A difference of maybe 15-30 min. if that, could catch the sun lower behind trees, cutting down on the brightness, yet still catching interesting shadows.</td>', 'I like the composition of your shot. I feel a little conflicted because I really like the shadows you''ve captured with this light/time of day, but that same light seems over exposed/burnt out in the center. Perhaps you could have waited a little or taken just a little sooner, depending on if it is morning or evening. A difference of maybe 15-30 min. if that, could catch the sun lower behind trees, cutting down on the brightness, yet still catching interesting shadows.', '2004-06-23 23:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
