(777271, 85263, 21367, '<td valign="top">Cool picture...a couple thoughts, it is a candid but if it was really to be a print in a newspaper I might have had the guy with the pole hold the fishing line so that it didn''t come across his face and I my have repositioned the older gentleman so the pole was not in front of his face.   I might have also cropped a bit from the left.  Good clear picture though.</td>', 'Cool picture...a couple thoughts, it is a candid but if it was really to be a print in a newspaper I might have had the guy with the pole hold the fishing line so that it didn''t come across his face and I my have repositioned the older gentleman so the pole was not in front of his face.   I might have also cropped a bit from the left.  Good clear picture though.', '2004-06-24 01:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
