(777276, 84965, 21367, '<td valign="top">Way too busy for me...too much white in the center of the picture, I seem to get lost.  Marinas are very hard to shoot, I try all the time here in San Diego and I meet with the same results.  The pack a lot of really cool boats in a small area.  Maybe try a different angle and I might have tried this from a little further back.  Not try capture so many boats but more detail of just a few.</td>', 'Way too busy for me...too much white in the center of the picture, I seem to get lost.  Marinas are very hard to shoot, I try all the time here in San Diego and I meet with the same results.  The pack a lot of really cool boats in a small area.  Maybe try a different angle and I might have tried this from a little further back.  Not try capture so many boats but more detail of just a few.', '2004-06-24 01:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(777277, 85221, 21158, '<td valign="top">you should have put emphasis on the uniform, not the person. the shot shold have included the pants and shoes. lower the shot.</td>', 'you should have put emphasis on the uniform, not the person. the shot shold have included the pants and shoes. lower the shot.', '2004-06-24 01:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(777280, 85269, 21367, '<td valign="top">Cool shot but this might be just a little to dark to make it to a newspaper.  I like the way the sun is flaring in the corner but where its at gives you little light to work with.  The term Great Season (and it is a good title), I think of Bright future, I might have shot this mid morning where all the crop just really pops out at the viewer.</td>', 'Cool shot but this might be just a little to dark to make it to a newspaper.  I like the way the sun is flaring in the corner but where its at gives you little light to work with.  The term Great Season (and it is a good title), I think of Bright future, I might have shot this mid morning where all the crop just really pops out at the viewer.', '2004-06-24 01:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
