(777290, 85335, 21367, '<td valign="top">Can''t argue with this one, something you definatley would see in the paper.  Great Idea.  Not the hightest quality picture, but mug shots never are.  I beleive that you took it intentionally this way to fit the bill.  Good job, great idea.</td>', 'Can''t argue with this one, something you definatley would see in the paper.  Great Idea.  Not the hightest quality picture, but mug shots never are.  I beleive that you took it intentionally this way to fit the bill.  Good job, great idea.', '2004-06-24 01:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
