(777314, 85015, 21367, '<td valign="top">Maybe a different title for this newspaper challenge.  Probably a dog park, but I see what appears to be a dog show going on in the background I may have played that angle.  There are those who may ding you for that title.  I may have cropped the dog on the right out as it seems to be a bit distracting.  Anyways very good picture with deep dof, everything is quite clear and sharp.  Good job.</td>', 'Maybe a different title for this newspaper challenge.  Probably a dog park, but I see what appears to be a dog show going on in the background I may have played that angle.  There are those who may ding you for that title.  I may have cropped the dog on the right out as it seems to be a bit distracting.  Anyways very good picture with deep dof, everything is quite clear and sharp.  Good job.', '2004-06-24 01:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(777317, 85283, 21158, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped out the guard rail.</td>', 'I would have cropped out the guard rail.', '2004-06-24 01:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(777318, 85336, 21367, '<td valign="top">Good newsworthy shot.  I don''t think the officer on the left needs to be in the picture as the wreckage tells the story here.  I may have moved the whole picture right centering more on the two vehicles involved.  Still a very good, clear shot.</td>', 'Good newsworthy shot.  I don''t think the officer on the left needs to be in the picture as the wreckage tells the story here.  I may have moved the whole picture right centering more on the two vehicles involved.  Still a very good, clear shot.', '2004-06-24 01:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
