(777326, 85317, 21367, '<td valign="top">Good shot, worthy of being in the Wine and Dining section of the paper.  Maybe just a bit warmer lighting would calm down those hot spots on a few of the pieces of lettuce that seem to be over powered a lose detail.  DOF could have been a tiny bit deeper as we are starting to lose detail of the salad items near the back edge of the plate.  It''s a very nice shot, I like the composition.</td>', 'Good shot, worthy of being in the Wine and Dining section of the paper.  Maybe just a bit warmer lighting would calm down those hot spots on a few of the pieces of lettuce that seem to be over powered a lose detail.  DOF could have been a tiny bit deeper as we are starting to lose detail of the salad items near the back edge of the plate.  It''s a very nice shot, I like the composition.', '2004-06-24 02:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
