(777334, 85122, 21367, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, a little too dark for a newspaper print.  I think I would have adjusted the levels up a bit to bring emphasis to dock and less on the weather, which is the feeling I get from the darkness.  Unless that is what you was going for...a storm coming in and blowing the dock away...then smack me.</td>', 'Very nice picture, a little too dark for a newspaper print.  I think I would have adjusted the levels up a bit to bring emphasis to dock and less on the weather, which is the feeling I get from the darkness.  Unless that is what you was going for...a storm coming in and blowing the dock away...then smack me.', '2004-06-24 02:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(777336, 85175, 21158, '<td valign="top">nice pic, bad headline</td>', 'nice pic, bad headline', '2004-06-24 02:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(777338, 84064, 18349, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing he''d go into the Obituary section...poor lil'' guy!  It''s a pretty good macro shot.  A little soft on the focus, but you can still make out a fair amount of detail. The bright bottom line is a tad distracting.  Your caption (title) might help your photo make more of an impact and a connection with the voters if it were to read like an obituary typically does, but that'' s just me assuming the voters might not "get" this one.  I think it''s a good attempt at the challenge.  :o)</td>', 'I''m guessing he''d go into the Obituary section...poor lil'' guy!  It''s a pretty good macro shot.  A little soft on the focus, but you can still make out a fair amount of detail. The bright bottom line is a tad distracting.  Your caption (title) might help your photo make more of an impact and a connection with the voters if it were to read like an obituary typically does, but that'' s just me assuming the voters might not "get" this one.  I think it''s a good attempt at the challenge.  :o)', '2004-06-24 02:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(777342, 84749, 21367, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, I like it.  Nice composition. It seems to be a little soft.  I don''t think I would have used noise reduction on this one.  B/W photos can stand to have a little edge and grain in them, it give them a feel of there own.  If you didn''t use NR and camera shots a little soft, I might have used Unsharp Mask to give it some bite.  Great idea.</td>', 'Interesting shot, I like it.  Nice composition. It seems to be a little soft.  I don''t think I would have used noise reduction on this one.  B/W photos can stand to have a little edge and grain in them, it give them a feel of there own.  If you didn''t use NR and camera shots a little soft, I might have used Unsharp Mask to give it some bite.  Great idea.', '2004-06-24 02:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(777346, 85230, 21158, '<td valign="top">newspapers do not use borders</td>', 'newspapers do not use borders', '2004-06-24 02:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(777349, 85282, 21158, '<td valign="top">drop the border</td>', 'drop the border', '2004-06-24 02:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(777351, 84655, 21158, '<td valign="top">front page pic. good job</td>', 'front page pic. good job', '2004-06-24 02:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(777357, 84361, 22046, '<td valign="top">This is my top pick in this challenge. The headline is good and the picture has great action and expression. I could actually picture this in a newspaper.</td>', 'This is my top pick in this challenge. The headline is good and the picture has great action and expression. I could actually picture this in a newspaper.', '2004-06-24 02:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(777361, 85333, 22046, '<td valign="top">Not really fond of your headline but I love your picture. I could see it in the paper for sure. Not sure what I''d put as a headline but it would have to be shorter. Maybe "Summer Street Musicians Thrive" - not sure but in any case I rated this as one of my top picks. Love the photo.</td>', 'Not really fond of your headline but I love your picture. I could see it in the paper for sure. Not sure what I''d put as a headline but it would have to be shorter. Maybe "Summer Street Musicians Thrive" - not sure but in any case I rated this as one of my top picks. Love the photo.', '2004-06-24 02:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(777362, 85146, 12573, '<td valign="top">Too bad those are probably all men.  Nice photo, though. ;)</td>', 'Too bad those are probably all men.  Nice photo, though. ;)', '2004-06-24 02:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(777366, 85000, 22046, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture. As I''ve found with many of the entries I like your picture better than your headline. Even so it is one of my top picks. I really love the wide depth of field and the bright colors.</td>', 'I really like this picture. As I''ve found with many of the entries I like your picture better than your headline. Even so it is one of my top picks. I really love the wide depth of field and the bright colors.', '2004-06-24 02:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(777368, 84628, 22046, '<td valign="top">You need a better headline but it is a great picture and certainly would appear in a newspaper. It is one of my top picks in this challenge.</td>', 'You need a better headline but it is a great picture and certainly would appear in a newspaper. It is one of my top picks in this challenge.', '2004-06-24 02:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(777375, 84729, 19831, '<td valign="top">wow. great shot. interesting perspective. l like how you''ve found an angle to make something so ordinary very interesting. this would be a good cover of a living or lifestyles section of the paper.</td>', 'wow. great shot. interesting perspective. l like how you''ve found an angle to make something so ordinary very interesting. this would be a good cover of a living or lifestyles section of the paper.', '2004-06-24 02:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(777381, 84064, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nicely detailed bug macro. I don''t know if you meant for it, but I find the bright bar across bottom quite distracting, maybe try cropping most of it out. I''m really trying to stretch the boundaries for this challenge and think of all the different sections of a paper, but sorry, i think this one is kind of being "shoehorned" in. perhaps a different title/headline sounding more "newsy" would help.</td>', 'Nicely detailed bug macro. I don''t know if you meant for it, but I find the bright bar across bottom quite distracting, maybe try cropping most of it out. I''m really trying to stretch the boundaries for this challenge and think of all the different sections of a paper, but sorry, i think this one is kind of being "shoehorned" in. perhaps a different title/headline sounding more "newsy" would help.', '2004-06-24 02:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(777383, 84522, 10263, '<td valign="top">I love this one. The water movement is great and the expression on the girls face is wonderful. Very nicely done :)</td>', 'I love this one. The water movement is great and the expression on the girls face is wonderful. Very nicely done :)', '2004-06-24 02:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(777390, 84649, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Good idea. I like your title. If it were possible, i think a different background might work better, it seems like way too much light/white colors.</td>', 'Nice shot. Good idea. I like your title. If it were possible, i think a different background might work better, it seems like way too much light/white colors.', '2004-06-24 03:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(777433, 84264, 20960, '<td valign="top">brilliant colours. excellent shot</td>', 'brilliant colours. excellent shot', '2004-06-24 03:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(777457, 85049, 18194, '<td valign="top">An interesting crop, it really gives a feeling for the number of people involved. One of the better photo in the challenge.</td>', 'An interesting crop, it really gives a feeling for the number of people involved. One of the better photo in the challenge.', '2004-06-24 03:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(777458, 85055, 18194, '<td valign="top">The facial expressions are great, this would fit right in on the spots page.</td>', 'The facial expressions are great, this would fit right in on the spots page.', '2004-06-24 03:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(777460, 85046, 18194, '<td valign="top">So is that really a golf course or did you put a flag at the end of a grass runway?  Either way the photo works fairly well.  It would have been nice to have a couple of golfer putting on the green.</td>', 'So is that really a golf course or did you put a flag at the end of a grass runway?  Either way the photo works fairly well.  It would have been nice to have a couple of golfer putting on the green.', '2004-06-24 03:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(777462, 84677, 18194, '<td valign="top">I really like the action in this photo.  It is just a little soft in focus.</td>', 'I really like the action in this photo.  It is just a little soft in focus.', '2004-06-24 03:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(777464, 85005, 18194, '<td valign="top">A good photo for capturing ones interest, which is what a newspaper photo should do, good work.</td>', 'A good photo for capturing ones interest, which is what a newspaper photo should do, good work.', '2004-06-24 04:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(777469, 85066, 18194, '<td valign="top">That is a pretty long caption for a photo in a paper.  Still it is a good photo and helps tell a story.</td>', 'That is a pretty long caption for a photo in a paper.  Still it is a good photo and helps tell a story.', '2004-06-24 04:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(777478, 84691, 22458, '<td valign="top">Great shot! The lighting perfectly captures the mood and highlights the singer''s face perfectly. This picture has been well cropped. Excellent effort!</td>', 'Great shot! The lighting perfectly captures the mood and highlights the singer''s face perfectly. This picture has been well cropped. Excellent effort!', '2004-06-24 04:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(777498, 85317, 22781, '<td valign="top">hmmm hungry....</td>', 'hmmm hungry....', '2004-06-24 04:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(777501, 84992, 22392, '<td valign="top">it looks like there''s not much for composition here. I like the people in the foreground, but it is disturbing that their legs are cut off. I would have made them the focus of the picture. Also the picture is very pale.</td>', 'it looks like there''s not much for composition here. I like the people in the foreground, but it is disturbing that their legs are cut off. I would have made them the focus of the picture. Also the picture is very pale.', '2004-06-24 04:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
