(777561, 84815, 23336, '<td valign="top">Hahaha. My mom just bought a house down there. I think it would look a little better with more of that for sale sign showing, but not all of it.</td>', 'Hahaha. My mom just bought a house down there. I think it would look a little better with more of that for sale sign showing, but not all of it.', '2004-06-24 05:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
