(777569, 85291, 23336, '<td valign="top">I think it would have worked better if you had them looking like they were patroling the beach and not looking at you. Its a good picture though.</td>', 'I think it would have worked better if you had them looking like they were patroling the beach and not looking at you. Its a good picture though.', '2004-06-24 05:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
