(777635, 85323, 18506, '<td valign="top">Nice shot :)</td>', 'Nice shot :)', '2004-06-24 07:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(777647, 84297, 5728, '<td valign="top">It''s actually spelled "Auschwitz", it''s written on the sign :)</td>', 'It''s actually spelled "Auschwitz", it''s written on the sign :)', '2004-06-24 08:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(777650, 85146, 5728, '<td valign="top">I''ve just decided where I am going for my next vacation, San Francisco :)))</td>', 'I''ve just decided where I am going for my next vacation, San Francisco :)))', '2004-06-24 08:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(777659, 85172, 5728, '<td valign="top">Is this one of those 7 buildings in Moscow that all look the same? I remember seeing a few of them when I was there last month.</td>', 'Is this one of those 7 buildings in Moscow that all look the same? I remember seeing a few of them when I was there last month.', '2004-06-24 08:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(777704, 84585, 164, '<td valign="top">I agree with the sentiment. I particularly like the older man and the the look on the face of the man in the background. I might have cropped it more on the right side for emphasis.</td>', 'I agree with the sentiment. I particularly like the older man and the the look on the face of the man in the background. I might have cropped it more on the right side for emphasis.', '2004-06-24 09:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(777706, 85170, 164, '<td valign="top">Great entry. Not to go into the last challenge but wouldn''t colorized flowers worked better?</td>', 'Great entry. Not to go into the last challenge but wouldn''t colorized flowers worked better?', '2004-06-24 09:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(777707, 84320, 164, '<td valign="top">Washed out the faces.</td>', 'Washed out the faces.', '2004-06-24 09:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(777733, 85302, 22825, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  Perhaps you could have moved the bridge down to about the 2/3 mark in the picture (rule of 3rds).</td>', 'Nice picture.  Perhaps you could have moved the bridge down to about the 2/3 mark in the picture (rule of 3rds).', '2004-06-24 10:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(777736, 85002, 22825, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice shot, but the drama of the picture doesn''t, to me, live up to the drama of the title.</td>', 'It''s a nice shot, but the drama of the picture doesn''t, to me, live up to the drama of the title.', '2004-06-24 10:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(777738, 85325, 22825, '<td valign="top">Challenge met, and beautiful picture.  9</td>', 'Challenge met, and beautiful picture.  9', '2004-06-24 10:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(777740, 84086, 22825, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but I''m not sure I get this as a newspaper headline.</td>', 'Nice picture, but I''m not sure I get this as a newspaper headline.', '2004-06-24 10:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(777742, 85149, 22825, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  Perhaps you could try a polarization filter to reduce glare?</td>', 'Nice picture.  Perhaps you could try a polarization filter to reduce glare?', '2004-06-24 10:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(777745, 84678, 22825, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  My only complaint is the washing out below the lights due to, I''m assuming, a long exposure.  Perhaps a graduated neutral density filter could have reduced this.  7</td>', 'Nice picture.  My only complaint is the washing out below the lights due to, I''m assuming, a long exposure.  Perhaps a graduated neutral density filter could have reduced this.  7', '2004-06-24 10:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(777747, 84812, 22825, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but overexposed.  I wonder how it would have come out if you used a flash to illuminate your subject, thus allowing a shorter shutter speed so the background didn''t get washed out.</td>', 'Nice idea, but overexposed.  I wonder how it would have come out if you used a flash to illuminate your subject, thus allowing a shorter shutter speed so the background didn''t get washed out.', '2004-06-24 10:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(777754, 85318, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice panning effect. A little less noise would''ve been easier on the eyes and I don''t remember the last time i saw an image that grainy in newsprint. Good effort though.</td>', 'Nice panning effect. A little less noise would''ve been easier on the eyes and I don''t remember the last time i saw an image that grainy in newsprint. Good effort though.', '2004-06-24 10:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(777760, 84961, 19841, '<td valign="top">What a great shot!  I like that there is a distinct difference between what he has cleaned, and what he hasn''t</td>', 'What a great shot!  I like that there is a distinct difference between what he has cleaned, and what he hasn''t', '2004-06-24 10:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(777763, 85187, 19841, '<td valign="top">I might have cropped a little closer in, but otherwise, this is great!</td>', 'I might have cropped a little closer in, but otherwise, this is great!', '2004-06-24 10:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(777775, 85270, 13688, '<td valign="top">I bow to your photo journalistic skills.</td>', 'I bow to your photo journalistic skills.', '2004-06-24 10:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(777777, 84264, 23163, '<td valign="top">We can see whats on your mind!</td>', 'We can see whats on your mind!', '2004-06-24 10:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(777779, 84628, 19841, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the headline, but this is an impressive picture.  You got all the important elements in it, the car, the fire trucks, and the brush fire.</td>', 'I don''t like the headline, but this is an impressive picture.  You got all the important elements in it, the car, the fire trucks, and the brush fire.', '2004-06-24 10:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(777795, 85318, 16493, '<td valign="top">You would benefit from tighter croping</td>', 'You would benefit from tighter croping', '2004-06-24 11:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(777802, 84786, 16241, '<td valign="top">top 20</td>', 'top 20', '2004-06-24 11:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(777810, 85046, 22922, '<td valign="top">I have to take points off for spelling and grammar in your headline, but this image meets the challenge sufficiently.  More people around the plane or on the course might have benefited the image.<br/> <br/>EDIT:<br/>In this particular contest, the headline is an important part of the challenge.  If English is not your native language, I would rather you wrote the headline properly in your native tongue than write a nonsensical headline in English. We had plenty of time in this challenge to formulate a strong headline. As it stood, your picture was not strong enough to "fly" without a solid headline, and your headline was too befuddled to make up for the ambivalent photo.  A newspaper photo should make the situation obvious, the headline is more like the title of the article than a description of the picture.</td>', 'I have to take points off for spelling and grammar in your headline, but this image meets the challenge sufficiently.  More people around the plane or on the course might have benefited the image. EDIT:In this particular contest, the headline is an important part of the challenge.  If English is not your native language, I would rather you wrote the headline properly in your native tongue than write a nonsensical headline in English. We had plenty of time in this challenge to formulate a strong headline. As it stood, your picture was not strong enough to "fly" without a solid headline, and your headline was too befuddled to make up for the ambivalent photo.  A newspaper photo should make the situation obvious, the headline is more like the title of the article than a description of the picture.', '2004-06-24 11:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(777813, 85323, 16126, '<td valign="top">I think you misunderstood the challenge: the target was not to take a picture with newspapers in it, but a picture that could appear in a newspaper.  Your title doesn''t make this appropriate for a newspaper article. Still a 7 because I like the image very much.</td>', 'I think you misunderstood the challenge: the target was not to take a picture with newspapers in it, but a picture that could appear in a newspaper.  Your title doesn''t make this appropriate for a newspaper article. Still a 7 because I like the image very much.', '2004-06-24 11:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(777823, 84691, 22781, '<td valign="top">Great picture, would have cropped the "head" of the bottom...</td>', 'Great picture, would have cropped the "head" of the bottom...', '2004-06-24 11:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(777827, 84564, 16126, '<td valign="top">Great action capture!  Would have been even better with just a little bit more of their shoe soles, and the left and right cropped off.</td>', 'Great action capture!  Would have been even better with just a little bit more of their shoe soles, and the left and right cropped off.', '2004-06-24 11:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(777836, 84319, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Would probably work well in color also. I might try a slightly tighter cropping.</td>', 'Great shot. Would probably work well in color also. I might try a slightly tighter cropping.', '2004-06-24 11:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(777840, 84374, 19831, '<td valign="top">It looks like it could be a little sharper. I''d say it seems like "shoehorning", but in this case I think the title makes it work.</td>', 'It looks like it could be a little sharper. I''d say it seems like "shoehorning", but in this case I think the title makes it work.', '2004-06-24 11:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(777843, 85130, 16126, '<td valign="top">Very evocative image.  The grain and slight unsharpness are very fitting.  For a newspaper item the title doesn''t seem appropriate though.  Also, I would have cropped out the two pedestrians to the right, leaving only the guy seen from the back walking away from the beggar. 7</td>', 'Very evocative image.  The grain and slight unsharpness are very fitting.  For a newspaper item the title doesn''t seem appropriate though.  Also, I would have cropped out the two pedestrians to the right, leaving only the guy seen from the back walking away from the beggar. 7', '2004-06-24 11:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(777844, 84692, 16126, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look real enough to believe the title, sorry.</td>', 'Doesn''t look real enough to believe the title, sorry.', '2004-06-24 11:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(777845, 85283, 19831, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective. Good crisp clear shot. Could you have got closer and avoided the rail in foreground? I don''t feel it hurts the shot too bad, but it is slightly distracting IMO.</td>', 'Interesting perspective. Good crisp clear shot. Could you have got closer and avoided the rail in foreground? I don''t feel it hurts the shot too bad, but it is slightly distracting IMO.', '2004-06-24 11:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
