(777854, 85260, 16126, '<td valign="top">I assume you had the net in focus instead of the players on purpose.  Makes this a confusing image to look at, I keep trying to adjust my eyes to get the players sharp.  More out of focus on the players would have helped, either that or actually focus on them.</td>', 'I assume you had the net in focus instead of the players on purpose.  Makes this a confusing image to look at, I keep trying to adjust my eyes to get the players sharp.  More out of focus on the players would have helped, either that or actually focus on them.', '2004-06-24 11:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
