(777859, 84853, 2752, '<td valign="top">the colors are great as is the set up and composition...the word rampage dosen''t fit for me somehow.</td>', 'the colors are great as is the set up and composition...the word rampage dosen''t fit for me somehow.', '2004-06-24 11:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
