(778518, 85249, 10263, '<td valign="top">Ha, this is funny. Good imagination.  A lower crop to get rid of some of the white in the sky might work better.  That much white takes away from the subject for me.</td>', 'Ha, this is funny. Good imagination.  A lower crop to get rid of some of the white in the sky might work better.  That much white takes away from the subject for me.', '2004-06-24 20:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
