(778560, 85212, 21621, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic photograph, I can see it on a gallery wall, but I dont think is direct enough to be on the cover of a newspaper (of course I may be wrong).<br/>Still, one of my top picks.  Great work!</td>', 'This is a fantastic photograph, I can see it on a gallery wall, but I dont think is direct enough to be on the cover of a newspaper (of course I may be wrong).Still, one of my top picks.  Great work!', '2004-06-24 21:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
