(778671, 85016, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m at a loss with this one. It appears to be a view of some garage clutter and the door through a car windshield. There is no connection to the challenge. This isn''t really much of a photo either. It is out of focus, there is a reflection that makes quite a large glare spot over the whole image. The subject is extremely mundane.</td>', 'I''m at a loss with this one. It appears to be a view of some garage clutter and the door through a car windshield. There is no connection to the challenge. This isn''t really much of a photo either. It is out of focus, there is a reflection that makes quite a large glare spot over the whole image. The subject is extremely mundane.', '2004-06-24 22:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(778676, 85213, 19134, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. I would die to capture a lightning shot. 10 for difficulty. Wow.</td>', 'Wonderful. I would die to capture a lightning shot. 10 for difficulty. Wow.', '2004-06-24 22:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(778677, 84203, 7322, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a journalistic photo and your title is not a headline. <br/> <br/>Photographically it might be more interesting from a side view. This looks rather flat and the bottom bug is obscured in shadow. Centering the subject doesn''t work to well with this composition because the edges of the leaves tend to draw your eye to either edge of the frame and away from the bugs.</td>', 'This isn''t a journalistic photo and your title is not a headline.  Photographically it might be more interesting from a side view. This looks rather flat and the bottom bug is obscured in shadow. Centering the subject doesn''t work to well with this composition because the edges of the leaves tend to draw your eye to either edge of the frame and away from the bugs.', '2004-06-24 22:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(778680, 85226, 19134, '<td valign="top">Cool image. Sad that with all of the money in the US that we still have to see images like this of our own kind.</td>', 'Cool image. Sad that with all of the money in the US that we still have to see images like this of our own kind.', '2004-06-24 22:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(778681, 84656, 7322, '<td valign="top">A human element might make this more convincing as a journalistic photo. Without that, it loses the immediacy of journalism and veers into still-life, landscape territory. <br/> <br/>Photographically it is a good subject. It is a bit overexposed to really be able to appreciate the textures and color.</td>', 'A human element might make this more convincing as a journalistic photo. Without that, it loses the immediacy of journalism and veers into still-life, landscape territory.  Photographically it is a good subject. It is a bit overexposed to really be able to appreciate the textures and color.', '2004-06-24 22:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(778682, 84564, 19134, '<td valign="top">Great action shot.</td>', 'Great action shot.', '2004-06-24 22:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(778687, 84862, 14614, '<td valign="top">I love these Naperville cows!  Extra point just for making me smile.  You''re shot fits the category, nice close up, would like the background a bit more blurry -- as presented, well done</td>', 'I love these Naperville cows!  Extra point just for making me smile.  You''re shot fits the category, nice close up, would like the background a bit more blurry -- as presented, well done', '2004-06-24 22:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
