(778696, 84205, 7322, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a jounralistic photo or a headline. It would be more appropriate for a brochure. <br/> <br/>Photographically, it is a pretty dull subject. The biggest problem is the image is far too small to really evaluate properly.</td>', 'This isn''t a jounralistic photo or a headline. It would be more appropriate for a brochure.  Photographically, it is a pretty dull subject. The biggest problem is the image is far too small to really evaluate properly.', '2004-06-24 22:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
