(778699, 85015, 14614, '<td valign="top">these are such great dogs!. very unusual coat -- looks like a blue meryl but with a red face.  how did you get him not to herd the other dogs?  :)  would like to be closer the the main subject and the background dogs</td>', 'these are such great dogs!. very unusual coat -- looks like a blue meryl but with a red face.  how did you get him not to herd the other dogs?  :)  would like to be closer the the main subject and the background dogs', '2004-06-24 22:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
