(778704, 85249, 19134, '<td valign="top">Funny. Cool shot.</td>', 'Funny. Cool shot.', '2004-06-24 22:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(778705, 84642, 7322, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a headline or a journalistic photo. For one thing, agriculture is not, in fact, abandoned. Journalism, ideally, deals with facts. Opinions are valid in an op-ed piece but that would reallyl be stretching it. At any rate, I don''t think you would find many journalist making the claim that agriculture has been abandoned. There is no human element in this photo so I can''t even ignore the headline and evaluate the photo as a journalistic photo. It is a very nice still-life but it fails to meet the challenge.<br/> <br/>Photographically, I like the angle. The cropping is a bit severe. I would have chosen to show the whole tractor. A little dodging to bring out some lights in the foreground would help to balance out the extreme lights and darks.</td>', 'This isn''t a headline or a journalistic photo. For one thing, agriculture is not, in fact, abandoned. Journalism, ideally, deals with facts. Opinions are valid in an op-ed piece but that would reallyl be stretching it. At any rate, I don''t think you would find many journalist making the claim that agriculture has been abandoned. There is no human element in this photo so I can''t even ignore the headline and evaluate the photo as a journalistic photo. It is a very nice still-life but it fails to meet the challenge. Photographically, I like the angle. The cropping is a bit severe. I would have chosen to show the whole tractor. A little dodging to bring out some lights in the foreground would help to balance out the extreme lights and darks.', '2004-06-24 22:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(778706, 85323, 19134, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2004-06-24 22:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(778708, 85251, 19134, '<td valign="top">Cool. Just too cool.</td>', 'Cool. Just too cool.', '2004-06-24 22:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(778709, 85313, 19134, '<td valign="top">Funny. Too funny. What happen to the divorce with J-LO &amp; Latin Lover? 8</td>', 'Funny. Too funny. What happen to the divorce with J-LO & Latin Lover? 8', '2004-06-24 22:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(778710, 84319, 19134, '<td valign="top">Looks like that right now in south louisiana. Great shot.</td>', 'Looks like that right now in south louisiana. Great shot.', '2004-06-24 22:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(778711, 85315, 7322, '<td valign="top">Your title isn''t a headline. It makes it difficult to evaluate this still-life as a journalistic photo since I don''t know what story it is meant to support. Therefore, I must conclude it doesn''t meet the challenge. <br/> <br/>Photographically, the cropping is a bit severe to really make much of the subject. The extremely shallow depth of field  combined with the cropping leaves very little of interest in focus. The section of flag in the background is in sharper focus then most of the sword or dagger. It took me awhile to make out that there is a uniform under the flag. I thought the splotching was weird artifacts from some kind of PS process. In the future, I would suggest you take advantage of the maximum image size. It is really difficult to evaluate a photo this small.</td>', 'Your title isn''t a headline. It makes it difficult to evaluate this still-life as a journalistic photo since I don''t know what story it is meant to support. Therefore, I must conclude it doesn''t meet the challenge.  Photographically, the cropping is a bit severe to really make much of the subject. The extremely shallow depth of field  combined with the cropping leaves very little of interest in focus. The section of flag in the background is in sharper focus then most of the sword or dagger. It took me awhile to make out that there is a uniform under the flag. I thought the splotching was weird artifacts from some kind of PS process. In the future, I would suggest you take advantage of the maximum image size. It is really difficult to evaluate a photo this small.', '2004-06-24 22:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(778712, 85059, 7322, '<td valign="top">The headline would be more effective if it identified and actual crisis.  A more effective supporting photo for a story like this would include a human element. Show the people getting out there in donating blood rather then a shot of blood and medical equipment which makes for very dull subject matter, particularly in black and white.</td>', 'The headline would be more effective if it identified and actual crisis.  A more effective supporting photo for a story like this would include a human element. Show the people getting out there in donating blood rather then a shot of blood and medical equipment which makes for very dull subject matter, particularly in black and white.', '2004-06-24 22:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(778713, 85002, 19134, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I think it would be really cool if the firefighter had more of a face of anguish. 9</td>', 'Great shot. I think it would be really cool if the firefighter had more of a face of anguish. 9', '2004-06-24 22:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(778715, 85170, 19134, '<td valign="top">Pretty Cool.</td>', 'Pretty Cool.', '2004-06-24 22:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(778716, 84839, 19134, '<td valign="top">I like the caption.</td>', 'I like the caption.', '2004-06-24 22:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(778717, 85011, 7322, '<td valign="top">This would be so great if some part of it were in focus. I like the blur, don''t get me wrong, but with motion blur photos their should be some sharp areas or else it just looks like camera shake. Using your slow sync flash would give you some motion blur but freeze some of the action so that there is some sharpness. I have absolutely no complaints with the capture and the composition. Both are perfect. I think you meant the headline to read, ...in Brazil but if English is your second language I can see where the mistake occured. One of the better one''s I''ve seen, in spite of the technical issues.</td>', 'This would be so great if some part of it were in focus. I like the blur, don''t get me wrong, but with motion blur photos their should be some sharp areas or else it just looks like camera shake. Using your slow sync flash would give you some motion blur but freeze some of the action so that there is some sharpness. I have absolutely no complaints with the capture and the composition. Both are perfect. I think you meant the headline to read, ...in Brazil but if English is your second language I can see where the mistake occured. One of the better one''s I''ve seen, in spite of the technical issues.', '2004-06-24 22:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(778718, 85325, 19134, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture. I think it could use alittle contrast adjustment.8</td>', 'Beautiful picture. I think it could use alittle contrast adjustment.8', '2004-06-24 22:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(778719, 85055, 19590, '<td valign="top">Good action shot</td>', 'Good action shot', '2004-06-24 22:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(778722, 85200, 19590, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2004-06-24 22:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(778726, 84522, 7322, '<td valign="top">The headline could use some work. It''s kind of grim for the lighthearted photo that is supporting your ''story''. A better title would mention a human element. This would make a nice human interest shot so I can see it as a journalistic photo. It''s a really good capture. I have no criticism of the photo except a minor nit about the other child who is discernable as a blur blur in the background. It distracts a bit from the simple background. Still, one of the best I''ve seen in this challenge.</td>', 'The headline could use some work. It''s kind of grim for the lighthearted photo that is supporting your ''story''. A better title would mention a human element. This would make a nice human interest shot so I can see it as a journalistic photo. It''s a really good capture. I have no criticism of the photo except a minor nit about the other child who is discernable as a blur blur in the background. It distracts a bit from the simple background. Still, one of the best I''ve seen in this challenge.', '2004-06-24 22:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(778728, 84429, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a somewhat interesting photo but it isn''t a journalistic photo and your headline does nothing to support it as such. <br/> <br/>Challenge aside, the fire isn''t quite fascinating enough to make this a truly compelling photo. I have no issues with the technical aspects---it''s a good capture---but after a few minutes of viewing it, I lose interest. <br/> <br/></td>', 'This is a somewhat interesting photo but it isn''t a journalistic photo and your headline does nothing to support it as such.  Challenge aside, the fire isn''t quite fascinating enough to make this a truly compelling photo. I have no issues with the technical aspects---it''s a good capture---but after a few minutes of viewing it, I lose interest.  ', '2004-06-24 22:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(778731, 84611, 7322, '<td valign="top">Your headline would be more convincing if this were not an extremely commonplace flower. If you are going to use the word you unique in the headline your content better deliver or your readers will feel cheated. <br/> <br/>Photographically, this is a pretty run-of-the-mill composition to stand out amongst the skads of flower shots seen on DPC every month. The overhead midday lighting is literal and dull.</td>', 'Your headline would be more convincing if this were not an extremely commonplace flower. If you are going to use the word you unique in the headline your content better deliver or your readers will feel cheated.  Photographically, this is a pretty run-of-the-mill composition to stand out amongst the skads of flower shots seen on DPC every month. The overhead midday lighting is literal and dull.', '2004-06-24 22:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(778732, 84678, 7322, '<td valign="top">A human element would make this much more interesting. Show some people milling about, or the actual artists. This is a pretty dull and literal view of a gallery. Most of the artwork is obscured by glare. The rest of the photo is just a boring view of the gallery floor, ropes, and some plants.</td>', 'A human element would make this much more interesting. Show some people milling about, or the actual artists. This is a pretty dull and literal view of a gallery. Most of the artwork is obscured by glare. The rest of the photo is just a boring view of the gallery floor, ropes, and some plants.', '2004-06-24 23:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(778733, 84619, 7322, '<td valign="top">Hurricane hits what town? Why be vague? It is journalism, meant to inform. <br/> <br/>Photographically, it isn''t bad. It looks very undexposed and maybe a tad out of focus. The tree at the lower edge of the center of the frame is very distracting and tends to draw the eye.</td>', 'Hurricane hits what town? Why be vague? It is journalism, meant to inform.  Photographically, it isn''t bad. It looks very undexposed and maybe a tad out of focus. The tree at the lower edge of the center of the frame is very distracting and tends to draw the eye.', '2004-06-24 23:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(778735, 85329, 7322, '<td valign="top">Who is too old? The dog or the lady? Why is this news? This might be more convincing as a journalistic photo if the headline made sense. As it is, it looks rather like a decent snapshot. It is a bit overexposed, we can''t see the dog''s face so the main interest is lost, and the guy is out of focus. The framing shows promise. Next time, get the dog''s attention so the viewer''s interest is drawn in. The people just aren''t compelling enough subjects and even if they were, their faces are effectively obscured by sunglasses.</td>', 'Who is too old? The dog or the lady? Why is this news? This might be more convincing as a journalistic photo if the headline made sense. As it is, it looks rather like a decent snapshot. It is a bit overexposed, we can''t see the dog''s face so the main interest is lost, and the guy is out of focus. The framing shows promise. Next time, get the dog''s attention so the viewer''s interest is drawn in. The people just aren''t compelling enough subjects and even if they were, their faces are effectively obscured by sunglasses.', '2004-06-24 23:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(778736, 85122, 7322, '<td valign="top">I would see this more as a journalistic photo if there were a human element or some more immediate indication of something newsworthy.Those few missing planks don''t quite cut it. It''s a very nice photo but it doesn''t quite work as photojournalism in spite of the headline.</td>', 'I would see this more as a journalistic photo if there were a human element or some more immediate indication of something newsworthy.Those few missing planks don''t quite cut it. It''s a very nice photo but it doesn''t quite work as photojournalism in spite of the headline.', '2004-06-24 23:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(778737, 85323, 16775, '<td valign="top">...</td>', '...', '2004-06-24 23:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
