(778743, 84086, 7322, '<td valign="top">Is this meant to be a story about children going hungry. The headline is too vague for journalism. Since the photo on its own doesn''t really have the feel of a journalism, it is hard to evaluate how this meets the challenge. <br/> <br/>The plate and table are awfully prominant in relation to the child. Then there is quite a bit of negative space created by the wall. I think I get what the intention is, I''m just not sure it is working. The child is just to far off in the distance and out of focus.</td>', 'Is this meant to be a story about children going hungry. The headline is too vague for journalism. Since the photo on its own doesn''t really have the feel of a journalism, it is hard to evaluate how this meets the challenge.  The plate and table are awfully prominant in relation to the child. Then there is quite a bit of negative space created by the wall. I think I get what the intention is, I''m just not sure it is working. The child is just to far off in the distance and out of focus.', '2004-06-24 23:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(778745, 85140, 7322, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite get the newsworthiness of the headline. Has there been a drought? To me, this looks like a entry from someone who was unwilling to stray from the comfort zone of their favorite subject matter and go out and make a journalstic photo. If you were categorizing this for the galleries would you honestly put this in the photojournalism category? It''s a lovely photo and I have no problems with it asthetically but it fails to meet the challenge. <br/> <br/></td>', 'I don''t quite get the newsworthiness of the headline. Has there been a drought? To me, this looks like a entry from someone who was unwilling to stray from the comfort zone of their favorite subject matter and go out and make a journalstic photo. If you were categorizing this for the galleries would you honestly put this in the photojournalism category? It''s a lovely photo and I have no problems with it asthetically but it fails to meet the challenge.  ', '2004-06-24 23:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
