(778915, 85228, 15811, '<td valign="top">imigrants have rights?</td>', 'imigrants have rights?', '2004-06-25 01:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(778918, 85055, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wow. What a great capture. The expressions are awesome. This is for sure something you could see on front of sports section. Nice job.</td>', 'Wow. What a great capture. The expressions are awesome. This is for sure something you could see on front of sports section. Nice job.', '2004-06-25 01:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(778920, 84944, 19831, '<td valign="top">I think this would be much stronger if it showed the actual flame.</td>', 'I think this would be much stronger if it showed the actual flame.', '2004-06-25 01:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(778921, 84585, 15811, '<td valign="top">screw them</td>', 'screw them', '2004-06-25 01:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(778927, 85200, 19831, '<td valign="top">very cute and clever. lol.  since the house is already cut off some, i might try going ahead and crop the car out.</td>', 'very cute and clever. lol.  since the house is already cut off some, i might try going ahead and crop the car out.', '2004-06-25 01:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(778929, 85044, 18677, '<td valign="top">looks just a little overexposed.  the dark outlines around the edge of the lightning looks unnatural.  i''m not sure what it is though.  for lightning that close, a good setting to use is 100 ISO and f/8.  i don''t like the wires/power lines going across the image, but I do like the way the lightning is nicely framed by the trees</td>', 'looks just a little overexposed.  the dark outlines around the edge of the lightning looks unnatural.  i''m not sure what it is though.  for lightning that close, a good setting to use is 100 ISO and f/8.  i don''t like the wires/power lines going across the image, but I do like the way the lightning is nicely framed by the trees', '2004-06-25 01:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(778932, 85304, 18677, '<td valign="top">focus looks perfect.  placement of the faces looks strange.  it looks like one guy has his nose in the other''s hair, and the dark shadow on the 3rd guy''s face hurts a lot.  but overall this is a nice picture and very appropriate for this challenge</td>', 'focus looks perfect.  placement of the faces looks strange.  it looks like one guy has his nose in the other''s hair, and the dark shadow on the 3rd guy''s face hurts a lot.  but overall this is a nice picture and very appropriate for this challenge', '2004-06-25 01:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(778934, 84551, 18677, '<td valign="top">a strong graduated neutral density filter would help this one a lot !!</td>', 'a strong graduated neutral density filter would help this one a lot !!', '2004-06-25 01:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(778939, 84704, 18677, '<td valign="top">excellent composition.  I think it would do better with a different title.  "Oversized camp fire" doesn''t sound like something newsworthy.  But I''m voting on the photo  not the title.. 8</td>', 'excellent composition.  I think it would do better with a different title.  "Oversized camp fire" doesn''t sound like something newsworthy.  But I''m voting on the photo  not the title.. 8', '2004-06-25 01:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(778941, 84064, 19608, '<td valign="top">I''m having a terrible time with your image - trying to find a way I might see it in a newspaper.  Except for the terrible white band at the bottom - the exposue seems accurate and the red eye provides a point of interest.  But honestly, other than that, it has too many flaws for me to give it more than a mediocre score.</td>', 'I''m having a terrible time with your image - trying to find a way I might see it in a newspaper.  Except for the terrible white band at the bottom - the exposue seems accurate and the red eye provides a point of interest.  But honestly, other than that, it has too many flaws for me to give it more than a mediocre score.', '2004-06-25 01:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(778942, 85015, 19608, '<td valign="top">Exposure is right on in very overcast (I assume) flat lighting.  The dog in the foreground is dead center - not to my taste.  (You could ealily crop from the left to about where the little guy in the red trunks  is - without huring the image.)  The title is cutesy - but I doubt if an editor would buy into it.</td>', 'Exposure is right on in very overcast (I assume) flat lighting.  The dog in the foreground is dead center - not to my taste.  (You could ealily crop from the left to about where the little guy in the red trunks  is - without huring the image.)  The title is cutesy - but I doubt if an editor would buy into it.', '2004-06-25 01:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(778944, 85174, 19608, '<td valign="top">Believable and an attractive model.  Lighting done well with non-obtrusive shadows.</td>', 'Believable and an attractive model.  Lighting done well with non-obtrusive shadows.', '2004-06-25 01:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(778951, 85318, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent "classic" newpaper look and feel.  Good use of shutter speed and grain.  My only complaint is that it''s so dead center,  Crop of about 3/4 of the distance from the left edge and the whitish cab and you have a much stronger image.   Oh - and get a better proof reader as " Fair" should be FARE!  But then again - if you are imiitating modern newspapers - maybe that was intentional!  Nice job.</td>', 'Excellent "classic" newpaper look and feel.  Good use of shutter speed and grain.  My only complaint is that it''s so dead center,  Crop of about 3/4 of the distance from the left edge and the whitish cab and you have a much stronger image.   Oh - and get a better proof reader as " Fair" should be FARE!  But then again - if you are imiitating modern newspapers - maybe that was intentional!  Nice job.', '2004-06-25 01:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(778954, 84697, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and exposure - but in a very centered composition.  I don''t get the headline though - if they are on strike, why are they working?</td>', 'Nice colors and exposure - but in a very centered composition.  I don''t get the headline though - if they are on strike, why are they working?', '2004-06-25 01:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(778961, 85260, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice idea an an appropriate news story, but I really doubt you could find many photo editors who would use a photo with the focus on the net.  Photographically - I do like it - but I''m not a photo editor.  The bright red object in the background is a bit overpowering.</td>', 'It''s a nice idea an an appropriate news story, but I really doubt you could find many photo editors who would use a photo with the focus on the net.  Photographically - I do like it - but I''m not a photo editor.  The bright red object in the background is a bit overpowering.', '2004-06-25 01:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(778964, 84646, 19608, '<td valign="top">Can you just picture this group on a deserted islkand somewhere - NOT!  Comical idea, good exposure....</td>', 'Can you just picture this group on a deserted islkand somewhere - NOT!  Comical idea, good exposure....', '2004-06-25 01:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(778966, 84611, 19608, '<td valign="top">A great specimen - and yes, I can believe it could be in some small town newspapers.  But oh - the lighting really was not your friend here.  You sould try it again with an umbrella or diffuser - or at some time of the day with out such harsh lighting.</td>', 'A great specimen - and yes, I can believe it could be in some small town newspapers.  But oh - the lighting really was not your friend here.  You sould try it again with an umbrella or diffuser - or at some time of the day with out such harsh lighting.', '2004-06-25 01:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(778969, 84297, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice rendering of a black and white scene for a possible news story.  The image does make one wonder why this type activity takes place.  You may need to hire a better proof reader, as I think you mean "Auschwitz".</td>', 'It''s a nice rendering of a black and white scene for a possible news story.  The image does make one wonder why this type activity takes place.  You may need to hire a better proof reader, as I think you mean "Auschwitz".', '2004-06-25 01:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(778976, 85240, 14043, '<td valign="top">In order of what comes to me first:<br/>1) Great idea.<br/>2) Great subject.<br/>3) Too bright of a light.  I don''t like how over-exposed it is on the right or how it overwhelms the picture.<br/>4) For a newspaper it would be best cropped to the dancers  As it is it would work great for a magazine or advertisement.<br/>5) I still really like it and it would have scored higher if it had met the challenge better.<br/>Score: 6</td>', 'In order of what comes to me first:1) Great idea.2) Great subject.3) Too bright of a light.  I don''t like how over-exposed it is on the right or how it overwhelms the picture.4) For a newspaper it would be best cropped to the dancers  As it is it would work great for a magazine or advertisement.5) I still really like it and it would have scored higher if it had met the challenge better.Score: 6', '2004-06-25 02:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(779010, 85301, 14043, '<td valign="top">This goes in order of what comes to mind first:<br/>1) Cute, but...<br/>2) I''d like to see more expression, I just know that a smile would look adorable on her face, but why isn''t there one?<br/>3) It''s obviously posed and it even could be but make something be happening, give it some life, have her look at the camera and connect with the reader.<br/>4) Great clarity and sofness/sharpness.<br/>Score: 5</td>', 'This goes in order of what comes to mind first:1) Cute, but...2) I''d like to see more expression, I just know that a smile would look adorable on her face, but why isn''t there one?3) It''s obviously posed and it even could be but make something be happening, give it some life, have her look at the camera and connect with the reader.4) Great clarity and sofness/sharpness.Score: 5', '2004-06-25 02:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(779021, 85226, 10263, '<td valign="top">Unfortunate but true.  A closer crop with less of the sidewalk might have been better, but I like the shot.</td>', 'Unfortunate but true.  A closer crop with less of the sidewalk might have been better, but I like the shot.', '2004-06-25 02:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(779026, 85063, 14043, '<td valign="top">1) Too small.<br/>2) Article title?<br/>3) Otherwise tood capture of the action.<br/>4) Good crop.<br/>Score: 5</td>', '1) Too small.2) Article title?3) Otherwise tood capture of the action.4) Good crop.Score: 5', '2004-06-25 02:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(779027, 84810, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite in the challenge so far.  You captured a wonderful expression and I love the gray scale.</td>', 'This is my favorite in the challenge so far.  You captured a wonderful expression and I love the gray scale.', '2004-06-25 02:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(779029, 84677, 14043, '<td valign="top">This goes in order of what I notice first:<br/>1) Crop to the bull and rider, we don''t care about the crowd, we want to see action!<br/>Score: 5</td>', 'This goes in order of what I notice first:1) Crop to the bull and rider, we don''t care about the crowd, we want to see action!Score: 5', '2004-06-25 02:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(779030, 85062, 14043, '<td valign="top">This goes in order of what I notice first:<br/>1) Crop to the street car, That way we can see the sign better and the people, the excess stuff doesn''t need to be there.<br/>Score: 5</td>', 'This goes in order of what I notice first:1) Crop to the street car, That way we can see the sign better and the people, the excess stuff doesn''t need to be there.Score: 5', '2004-06-25 02:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(779032, 85335, 10263, '<td valign="top">He''s guilty for sure. Look at those beady eyes! This is funny :)  He should have powdered his nose a bit. This fits the challenge well and the gray tones was a good choice I think.</td>', 'He''s guilty for sure. Look at those beady eyes! This is funny :)  He should have powdered his nose a bit. This fits the challenge well and the gray tones was a good choice I think.', '2004-06-25 02:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(779034, 84679, 14043, '<td valign="top">This goes in order of what I notice first:<br/>1) Boost the colors a bit by adjusting the contrast, it seems really dull, although I know paper photos can be, they don''t have to be.<br/>2) Rotate a bit to make the line of the box parallel to the bottom edge, it just seems like he''s ready to fall backwards.<br/>Score: 5</td>', 'This goes in order of what I notice first:1) Boost the colors a bit by adjusting the contrast, it seems really dull, although I know paper photos can be, they don''t have to be.2) Rotate a bit to make the line of the box parallel to the bottom edge, it just seems like he''s ready to fall backwards.Score: 5', '2004-06-25 02:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(779036, 84642, 10263, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the subject a lot. I also like the muted tones. The sky is a little bright. Having more tractor and less sky might have helped.</td>', 'I like the composition and the subject a lot. I also like the muted tones. The sky is a little bright. Having more tractor and less sky might have helped.', '2004-06-25 02:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(779039, 84704, 772, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  I love the silhouette and the simple intensity of the heat and flames.  I hope to see a ribbon on this one... great work :)</td>', 'This is beautiful.  I love the silhouette and the simple intensity of the heat and flames.  I hope to see a ribbon on this one... great work :)', '2004-06-25 02:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(779042, 85019, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is very nice. The colors of the flag are so bright and crisp against the muted tones of the building and sky.</td>', 'This is very nice. The colors of the flag are so bright and crisp against the muted tones of the building and sky.', '2004-06-25 02:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(779043, 85228, 14043, '<td valign="top">This goes in order of what I notice first:<br/>1) I decided when I started voting/commenting that I wouldn''t mention color vs. black and white...but I''m sorry, this picture just screamed COLOR to me.  :(<br/>2) Crop it more on the top and right side or even make it horizontal and crop it from his elbows to half of the basket.<br/>3) Good lighting and contrast.<br/>4) Good DOF.<br/>Score: 6</td>', 'This goes in order of what I notice first:1) I decided when I started voting/commenting that I wouldn''t mention color vs. black and white...but I''m sorry, this picture just screamed COLOR to me.  :(2) Crop it more on the top and right side or even make it horizontal and crop it from his elbows to half of the basket.3) Good lighting and contrast.4) Good DOF.Score: 6', '2004-06-25 02:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(779067, 85318, 20324, '<td valign="top">I like the grain. I would crop it differently, putting more space in front of the bike. (9)</td>', 'I like the grain. I would crop it differently, putting more space in front of the bike. (9)', '2004-06-25 03:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(779071, 85323, 20324, '<td valign="top">I like the picture, but I don''t care for the title. For me the picture is more important than the title. (10)</td>', 'I like the picture, but I don''t care for the title. For me the picture is more important than the title. (10)', '2004-06-25 03:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
