(779249, 84810, 1368, '<td valign="top">I think the cropping is mabey a little too tight in this one, I feel it needs some space under his  chin especially, mabey could have been better too with smaller apparture So that the background would be more blurred and not distract from the subject, I like his expression there is a lot of story in his face, good luck :)</td>', 'I think the cropping is mabey a little too tight in this one, I feel it needs some space under his  chin especially, mabey could have been better too with smaller apparture So that the background would be more blurred and not distract from the subject, I like his expression there is a lot of story in his face, good luck :)', '2004-06-25 08:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
