(779987, 84933, 6405, '<td valign="top">Keep it in family album,not for a challenge shot,3<br/>Cute kid though :-)</td>', 'Keep it in family album,not for a challenge shot,3Cute kid though :-)', '2004-06-25 21:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
