(780107, 85049, 3599, '<td valign="top">I can''t see the boat, Is it supposed to look like a Dragon?  Also maybe leave a little room in front of the boat.  I think that gives the viewer an idea of where the subject is going.</td>', 'I can''t see the boat, Is it supposed to look like a Dragon?  Also maybe leave a little room in front of the boat.  I think that gives the viewer an idea of where the subject is going.', '2004-06-26 00:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(780110, 85200, 3599, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming this is a joke but either way it is good picture that tells a story with the headline helping out.  May have tried to not get the car in the shot but I guess that wasn''t possible.</td>', 'I''m assuming this is a joke but either way it is good picture that tells a story with the headline helping out.  May have tried to not get the car in the shot but I guess that wasn''t possible.', '2004-06-26 00:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(780112, 84691, 3599, '<td valign="top">Nice concert photo and headline.  I could certainly see this in the newspaper''s entertainment or local section.  Good work and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice concert photo and headline.  I could certainly see this in the newspaper''s entertainment or local section.  Good work and good luck in the challenge.', '2004-06-26 00:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(780122, 85017, 14773, '<td valign="top">I saw them in Calgary, Alberta a few months back and was right on the first balcony directly by the stage; could smell the sweat and read their tattoos :-) It was awesome!</td>', 'I saw them in Calgary, Alberta a few months back and was right on the first balcony directly by the stage; could smell the sweat and read their tattoos :-) It was awesome!', '2004-06-26 00:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(780124, 85156, 3599, '<td valign="top">The newpaper would most likely crop the guy in the white t-shirt out of the picture, the bottom grassy area and the road sign on the right.  Is the white thing the body or just debris?  Also, this photo doesn''t say body found to me.  Maybe a headline  investigators seek clues in local hit and run.  Just a thought.</td>', 'The newpaper would most likely crop the guy in the white t-shirt out of the picture, the bottom grassy area and the road sign on the right.  Is the white thing the body or just debris?  Also, this photo doesn''t say body found to me.  Maybe a headline  investigators seek clues in local hit and run.  Just a thought.', '2004-06-26 00:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(780125, 84649, 22307, '<td valign="top">I gave this photo a 10 b/c it tells a story. The background really makes the subject stand out, even though it''s not the most colorful photo. Very narrative- great job!<br/></td>', 'I gave this photo a 10 b/c it tells a story. The background really makes the subject stand out, even though it''s not the most colorful photo. Very narrative- great job!', '2004-06-26 00:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(780130, 85075, 22307, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming you did this with a strobe? Although it''s not the most descriptive photo, which I was looking for in this challenge, the portrait-quality image was still enough for me to give it a ten. Good job</td>', 'I''m assuming you did this with a strobe? Although it''s not the most descriptive photo, which I was looking for in this challenge, the portrait-quality image was still enough for me to give it a ten. Good job', '2004-06-26 00:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(780131, 84757, 22307, '<td valign="top">The expressions are superb! This photo tells a story, which was important to me when rating this challenge. The composition is also very nice, but I wish it were a tad more in focus. Good job though</td>', 'The expressions are superb! This photo tells a story, which was important to me when rating this challenge. The composition is also very nice, but I wish it were a tad more in focus. Good job though', '2004-06-26 00:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(780133, 85059, 3599, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the title as it relates to the picture.  If the picture had people then I could see the word use of Blood Donors but in this picture we see donations so how about "Blood Donations Avert Crisis"  I like the picture but maybe a tighter crop on the top of the photo.</td>', 'I don''t understand the title as it relates to the picture.  If the picture had people then I could see the word use of Blood Donors but in this picture we see donations so how about "Blood Donations Avert Crisis"  I like the picture but maybe a tighter crop on the top of the photo.', '2004-06-26 00:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(780136, 85268, 22307, '<td valign="top">Superb reflection &amp; exposure. There''s very little visible noise, and I can totally see this under a headline in a paper. The color is spectacular as well, good job</td>', 'Superb reflection & exposure. There''s very little visible noise, and I can totally see this under a headline in a paper. The color is spectacular as well, good job', '2004-06-26 00:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(780137, 85212, 22307, '<td valign="top">There were plenty of homeless photos in this challenge- this one was my favorite by far. The contrast &amp; composition are great, and I like only seeing the feet- it''s much more mysterious, while at the same time identifyable. good job</td>', 'There were plenty of homeless photos in this challenge- this one was my favorite by far. The contrast & composition are great, and I like only seeing the feet- it''s much more mysterious, while at the same time identifyable. good job', '2004-06-26 00:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(780138, 84735, 22307, '<td valign="top">This is a perfect newspaper story type photo, very descriptive and the plane really stands out. My only quip is that for a paper, the water is kind of hard to distinguish from the clouds. Other than that, great job</td>', 'This is a perfect newspaper story type photo, very descriptive and the plane really stands out. My only quip is that for a paper, the water is kind of hard to distinguish from the clouds. Other than that, great job', '2004-06-26 00:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(780141, 84698, 22307, '<td valign="top">If only you had used a slighly higher shutter speed &amp; caught the drip, i''d have given this a ten. The blur distracts me, but the composition is amazing; perspective, sillouhette, &amp; color- fantastic! I love it, great job</td>', 'If only you had used a slighly higher shutter speed & caught the drip, i''d have given this a ten. The blur distracts me, but the composition is amazing; perspective, sillouhette, & color- fantastic! I love it, great job', '2004-06-26 00:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(780144, 84169, 22307, '<td valign="top">my favorite aspect is the composition, good job</td>', 'my favorite aspect is the composition, good job', '2004-06-26 00:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(780145, 85322, 22307, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo- the shallow depth of field- i can definately see this being used in a newspaper. I like the organic &amp; mechanical aspects as well, good job</td>', 'This is a great photo- the shallow depth of field- i can definately see this being used in a newspaper. I like the organic & mechanical aspects as well, good job', '2004-06-26 00:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(780148, 85005, 22307, '<td valign="top">could be a little sharper- but besides that it has a lot of unique elements, and the color is nice, good job</td>', 'could be a little sharper- but besides that it has a lot of unique elements, and the color is nice, good job', '2004-06-26 00:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(780149, 84636, 22307, '<td valign="top">One of the better sports shots from this challenge- very crisp!</td>', 'One of the better sports shots from this challenge- very crisp!', '2004-06-26 00:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(780150, 84624, 16046, '<td valign="top">looks more like Atlanta''s "fattest", good shot</td>', 'looks more like Atlanta''s "fattest", good shot', '2004-06-26 00:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(780151, 85212, 23170, '<td valign="top">One word for for this photograph  INCREDIBLE!!!!!</td>', 'One word for for this photograph  INCREDIBLE!!!!!', '2004-06-26 00:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(780152, 85306, 22307, '<td valign="top">I dont'' know about using this photo for a newspaper- i don''t necessarily see how it relates to this challege. That aside- great photo! Very ferocious, and I like the depth of field. A little grainy, but ok. Good job!</td>', 'I dont'' know about using this photo for a newspaper- i don''t necessarily see how it relates to this challege. That aside- great photo! Very ferocious, and I like the depth of field. A little grainy, but ok. Good job!', '2004-06-26 00:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(780154, 84704, 22307, '<td valign="top">It tells a story, it has so much movement, the color &amp; sillouhette- it''s all superb. Newspaper worth by far- i gave it an 8 at first, but i now give it a 9. great job</td>', 'It tells a story, it has so much movement, the color & sillouhette- it''s all superb. Newspaper worth by far- i gave it an 8 at first, but i now give it a 9. great job', '2004-06-26 00:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(780157, 85228, 22307, '<td valign="top">this is such a descriptive photo- the only  thing i''d say is a little more contrast. i like the depth of field, and the whole photo tells a great story. i can see it in a newspaper setting, good job</td>', 'this is such a descriptive photo- the only  thing i''d say is a little more contrast. i like the depth of field, and the whole photo tells a great story. i can see it in a newspaper setting, good job', '2004-06-26 00:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(780158, 85140, 22307, '<td valign="top">a great macro- but i don''t quite see why you''d choose it for this challenge. it''s beautiful though, with lots of contrast &amp; gorgeous color. great job</td>', 'a great macro- but i don''t quite see why you''d choose it for this challenge. it''s beautiful though, with lots of contrast & gorgeous color. great job', '2004-06-26 00:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(780160, 84522, 22307, '<td valign="top">i might have moved out to include a little more of the splash, but it captures a great moment. the lighting is great- i know how harsh daylight can be, and this is great- nothing seems to be overexposed. good job</td>', 'i might have moved out to include a little more of the splash, but it captures a great moment. the lighting is great- i know how harsh daylight can be, and this is great- nothing seems to be overexposed. good job', '2004-06-26 00:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(780162, 85257, 22307, '<td valign="top">good subject, but poor photo- watch out for hands/cars in the foreground, and the pole cutting off the cop on the right. It''s not super sharp either- those aside, it''s a good idea, just needs cleaning up</td>', 'good subject, but poor photo- watch out for hands/cars in the foreground, and the pole cutting off the cop on the right. It''s not super sharp either- those aside, it''s a good idea, just needs cleaning up', '2004-06-26 00:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(780164, 85130, 22307, '<td valign="top">has potential-but photo quality is too poor</td>', 'has potential-but photo quality is too poor', '2004-06-26 00:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(780170, 85226, 3599, '<td valign="top">How about a simpler headline "Homeless Rate Increases"  Nice picture, I''m not sure I like the composition but I can''t think of another way of shooting this.</td>', 'How about a simpler headline "Homeless Rate Increases"  Nice picture, I''m not sure I like the composition but I can''t think of another way of shooting this.', '2004-06-26 01:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(780171, 85062, 200, '<td valign="top">are you my neighbor????</td>', 'are you my neighbor????', '2004-06-26 01:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(780178, 85018, 3599, '<td valign="top">Queuing up for what?  Sorry I just don''t understand what this is.</td>', 'Queuing up for what?  Sorry I just don''t understand what this is.', '2004-06-26 01:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(780187, 85210, 3599, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  I think the headline would be a little better if it were simpler.  Like "Yacht Race Starts Amid High Winds".  If it is in a newspaper then it is likely to be timely, the reader knows its 2004 and many papers only publish a morning edition so the photo would actually be from yesterday.</td>', 'Nice photo.  I think the headline would be a little better if it were simpler.  Like "Yacht Race Starts Amid High Winds".  If it is in a newspaper then it is likely to be timely, the reader knows its 2004 and many papers only publish a morning edition so the photo would actually be from yesterday.', '2004-06-26 01:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(780220, 84766, 11756, '<td valign="top">a little too much PS for me.  Loses alot of detail that way and the color schme is ugly.</td>', 'a little too much PS for me.  Loses alot of detail that way and the color schme is ugly.', '2004-06-26 01:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(780225, 84691, 11756, '<td valign="top">nice shot.  great sharpness in low light.  good capture of the moment.</td>', 'nice shot.  great sharpness in low light.  good capture of the moment.', '2004-06-26 01:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(780227, 84688, 11756, '<td valign="top">kinds soft and the background is kinda boring.  Maybe a tighter crop around the alien</td>', 'kinds soft and the background is kinda boring.  Maybe a tighter crop around the alien', '2004-06-26 02:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(780229, 85269, 11756, '<td valign="top">nice.  I like the sun beams</td>', 'nice.  I like the sun beams', '2004-06-26 02:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(780231, 85260, 11756, '<td valign="top">think the focus should be a little farther out</td>', 'think the focus should be a little farther out', '2004-06-26 02:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(780233, 85318, 11756, '<td valign="top">nice panning but why all the noise?</td>', 'nice panning but why all the noise?', '2004-06-26 02:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(780246, 85279, 19608, '<td valign="top">Newsworthy - you bet.  Perspective works very well.  Just a bit overexposed.</td>', 'Newsworthy - you bet.  Perspective works very well.  Just a bit overexposed.', '2004-06-26 02:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(780247, 84169, 19608, '<td valign="top">I''m very sorry - but since you posted the details of your shot in one of the forums - I don''t feel right about commenting on it.</td>', 'I''m very sorry - but since you posted the details of your shot in one of the forums - I don''t feel right about commenting on it.', '2004-06-26 02:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(780248, 85171, 19608, '<td valign="top">The lighting makes the colors really snap!   It qualifies as a newpaper article - but not a very compelling one.  Good action and a great pose that says a lot.</td>', 'The lighting makes the colors really snap!   It qualifies as a newpaper article - but not a very compelling one.  Good action and a great pose that says a lot.', '2004-06-26 02:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(780249, 84565, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great time of day so the lighting is very pleasing.  I guess it could be a newsstory in a small seaport town. What a classic 3-master!</td>', 'Great time of day so the lighting is very pleasing.  I guess it could be a newsstory in a small seaport town. What a classic 3-master!', '2004-06-26 02:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(780253, 85307, 19608, '<td valign="top">Aw come on!  Some cat lovers will do anything for an excuse to enter a cat picture!  Nice exposure - consideribng the metering of a nearly all black subject.  Eyes are very expressive.  "Headline" is very weak - how about "Rabies outbreak in domestic pets!"</td>', 'Aw come on!  Some cat lovers will do anything for an excuse to enter a cat picture!  Nice exposure - consideribng the metering of a nearly all black subject.  Eyes are very expressive.  "Headline" is very weak - how about "Rabies outbreak in domestic pets!"', '2004-06-26 02:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(780258, 84636, 19608, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture!  Great exposure, perspective, shutter speed, and DoF.  I personally think the border detracts and would bet most newspapers would not publish it with a border.  Having said that - you should finish up in the stratosphere with this one.</td>', 'Awesome capture!  Great exposure, perspective, shutter speed, and DoF.  I personally think the border detracts and would bet most newspapers would not publish it with a border.  Having said that - you should finish up in the stratosphere with this one.', '2004-06-26 02:35:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(780259, 85274, 19608, '<td valign="top">Sad but true  and definitely a typical newspaper story.  Nice B&amp;W rendering.  It would be even better with a human or animal presence somehow.</td>', 'Sad but true  and definitely a typical newspaper story.  Nice B&W rendering.  It would be even better with a human or animal presence somehow.', '2004-06-26 02:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(780263, 84970, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice exposure - flat (overcast?) lighting was your friend.  Good model - composition a bit centered.  Artistically - remove the green sprig on the bottom edge. Newsworthy - maybe, just maybe in a small rural paper.</td>', 'Very nice exposure - flat (overcast?) lighting was your friend.  Good model - composition a bit centered.  Artistically - remove the green sprig on the bottom edge. Newsworthy - maybe, just maybe in a small rural paper.', '2004-06-26 02:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(780264, 84635, 19608, '<td valign="top">News?  YOU BET.  Model''s happiness is evident. Exposure right on.  Composition - I wish you would have waited until there were no orange traffic cone in the image if you could have.</td>', 'News?  YOU BET.  Model''s happiness is evident. Exposure right on.  Composition - I wish you would have waited until there were no orange traffic cone in the image if you could have.', '2004-06-26 02:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(780271, 84522, 10170, '<td valign="top">Lovely and crisp and a great moment captured.</td>', 'Lovely and crisp and a great moment captured.', '2004-06-26 03:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(780272, 84522, 19608, '<td valign="top">Cool - nice capture.  Great action, model and expression.  Shutter speed just right to capture the water.Too bad the second person merges with the main model.  Border does not help.</td>', 'Cool - nice capture.  Great action, model and expression.  Shutter speed just right to capture the water.Too bad the second person merges with the main model.  Border does not help.', '2004-06-26 03:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(780284, 85308, 10170, '<td valign="top">Excellent sports capture, and the bright colours are supberb.</td>', 'Excellent sports capture, and the bright colours are supberb.', '2004-06-26 03:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(780287, 85080, 10170, '<td valign="top">Excellent, especially with the ball in the corner.</td>', 'Excellent, especially with the ball in the corner.', '2004-06-26 03:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(780289, 85306, 10170, '<td valign="top">Fantastic close up and great angle.  I have to wonder, though I have not seen the original, if a colour version may have been better (or maybe you interpreded the challenge as needing b&amp;W, which is fair enough)</td>', 'Fantastic close up and great angle.  I have to wonder, though I have not seen the original, if a colour version may have been better (or maybe you interpreded the challenge as needing b&W, which is fair enough)', '2004-06-26 03:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(780293, 85270, 21621, '<td valign="top">Good Work</td>', 'Good Work', '2004-06-26 03:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(780320, 85214, 20375, '<td valign="top">Good idea...too shallow depth of field.</td>', 'Good idea...too shallow depth of field.', '2004-06-26 04:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(780322, 85017, 19608, '<td valign="top">Unusual colors but great emotion.</td>', 'Unusual colors but great emotion.', '2004-06-26 05:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(780323, 85212, 19608, '<td valign="top">This is a very emotional image. The dirty foot with no shoe is a great touch (assuming you used a staged model.) Lighting exceptional.</td>', 'This is a very emotional image. The dirty foot with no shoe is a great touch (assuming you used a staged model.) Lighting exceptional.', '2004-06-26 05:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(780324, 84704, 19608, '<td valign="top">Perfect plaement to make the silhouette.  Newspapers love these as the high contrast makes it easier to print.</td>', 'Perfect plaement to make the silhouette.  Newspapers love these as the high contrast makes it easier to print.', '2004-06-26 05:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
