(780632, 85289, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very graphic image with nice lines and repeating shapes.  Print is rather muddy though with no real "black blacks" or "white whites".  And the border draws attention to the lack of whites as it''s the brighest area of the scene.  The title/headline does make it a news story on a slow news day.</td>', 'A very graphic image with nice lines and repeating shapes.  Print is rather muddy though with no real "black blacks" or "white whites".  And the border draws attention to the lack of whites as it''s the brighest area of the scene.  The title/headline does make it a news story on a slow news day.', '2004-06-26 15:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
