(780653, 85047, 12611, '<td valign="top">The road is not black enough , and the shot would do better if there were red lights in it to add to the frustration- I mean- there are no cars and a green light in this shot- free sailing. Composition is nice though- and heck- lansing is somewhere near detroit right- and both me and richard "rip" hamilton of the pistons went to UCONN - I''ll score you up a notch or two.</td>', 'The road is not black enough , and the shot would do better if there were red lights in it to add to the frustration- I mean- there are no cars and a green light in this shot- free sailing. Composition is nice though- and heck- lansing is somewhere near detroit right- and both me and richard "rip" hamilton of the pistons went to UCONN - I''ll score you up a notch or two.', '2004-06-26 15:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(780656, 85328, 327, '<td valign="top">Hi there. This is most likely something you might see in the paper, good entry. I would have scored this higher if it was black and white. My reason is that the ground is over exposed and takes away from the sealion. Good luck to ya.</td>', 'Hi there. This is most likely something you might see in the paper, good entry. I would have scored this higher if it was black and white. My reason is that the ground is over exposed and takes away from the sealion. Good luck to ya.', '2004-06-26 15:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(780657, 85327, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love this but the building is not so photogenic. Very plaid.  I love the composition though. Extra points for having to live in Cleveland. Best of Luck</td>', 'I love this but the building is not so photogenic. Very plaid.  I love the composition though. Extra points for having to live in Cleveland. Best of Luck', '2004-06-26 15:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(780658, 84944, 327, '<td valign="top">Lucky guy. This would of scored higher if we could of seen the torch. Sorry, but the crop or composition is weak. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Lucky guy. This would of scored higher if we could of seen the torch. Sorry, but the crop or composition is weak. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-06-26 15:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
