(780661, 84590, 12611, '<td valign="top">This is O.K. The grass is a bit digitally green and almost looks cloned. The graffiti has awesome blues and the train is fantastic. Great composition and wonederful daylight for this shot - looks like 10 am or 4:30 pm.<br/>nice work</td>', 'This is O.K. The grass is a bit digitally green and almost looks cloned. The graffiti has awesome blues and the train is fantastic. Great composition and wonederful daylight for this shot - looks like 10 am or 4:30 pm.nice work', '2004-06-26 16:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
