(780853, 84585, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is definitely newspaper-type material, just not all newspapers.  I can neither agree nor disagree with the content, but the photo itself is fairly well-made and captured at a decent angle.  The lighting appears to be from midday sun, which makes it a bit flat with harsh shadows, but in news you take what you get, right?  I am sure it was rather interesting, being there in person...hope you weren''t one of the people on the receiving end of "the bird."  I also hope you don''t suffer from the political voters rather than those who vote based on photographic merit.  :o)</td>', 'This is definitely newspaper-type material, just not all newspapers.  I can neither agree nor disagree with the content, but the photo itself is fairly well-made and captured at a decent angle.  The lighting appears to be from midday sun, which makes it a bit flat with harsh shadows, but in news you take what you get, right?  I am sure it was rather interesting, being there in person...hope you weren''t one of the people on the receiving end of "the bird."  I also hope you don''t suffer from the political voters rather than those who vote based on photographic merit.  :o)', '2004-06-26 21:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
