(781098, 85268, 14355, '<td valign="top">I like this allot - it''s a good shot you''d find on the front of any paper.  The six point filter has a nice touch.  However, newspaper photographers have ethics and are FORBIDDEN to change the picture - that 6pt would have gotten you fired :(   The picture looks about 2.5 degrees off to the left - and it works great so long as everyone  notices the shot is from a boat - you should have mentioned this  this in your title to prevent misunderstandings.   If you get tired of that 6pt you may want to change to a Tiffen HyperStar or VectorStar - would have given you a more dramatic effect with a new look - they are not inexpensive filters but can be found quite reasonable on ebay.  Rated 10</td>', 'I like this allot - it''s a good shot you''d find on the front of any paper.  The six point filter has a nice touch.  However, newspaper photographers have ethics and are FORBIDDEN to change the picture - that 6pt would have gotten you fired :(   The picture looks about 2.5 degrees off to the left - and it works great so long as everyone  notices the shot is from a boat - you should have mentioned this  this in your title to prevent misunderstandings.   If you get tired of that 6pt you may want to change to a Tiffen HyperStar or VectorStar - would have given you a more dramatic effect with a new look - they are not inexpensive filters but can be found quite reasonable on ebay.  Rated 10', '2004-06-27 01:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(781101, 85234, 16255, '<td valign="top">Although I got your point, remember that spelling is key in newspapers.  Demolition.</td>', 'Although I got your point, remember that spelling is key in newspapers.  Demolition.', '2004-06-27 01:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(781102, 85268, 16255, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot, but newspaper usually need something more closeup and detailed showing the actual site of a disaster.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot, but newspaper usually need something more closeup and detailed showing the actual site of a disaster.', '2004-06-27 02:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(781107, 85277, 16520, '<td valign="top">nice comp fits the challenge well ......8</td>', 'nice comp fits the challenge well ......8', '2004-06-27 02:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(781112, 85044, 14355, '<td valign="top">I like this shot allot.  Your 490x488 supbission aspect was a wise choice to reduced the noise that is still visable.  The best way to reduce noise is when taking the photo - and this one probably would have still worked fine at 1/2 to 1/4  the ISO selected..... just keep cycling the shutter.  If you havent already, the PS noise reduction filter and unsharp mask could reduce the nose more.   Another program called Neat Image (www.neatimage.com ) comes highly recommended too.  I like how the trees ghosted from the long shutter opening.  The lens flare deffinitly adds to the spooky-ness of the picture.   Very nice captrue.</td>', 'I like this shot allot.  Your 490x488 supbission aspect was a wise choice to reduced the noise that is still visable.  The best way to reduce noise is when taking the photo - and this one probably would have still worked fine at 1/2 to 1/4  the ISO selected..... just keep cycling the shutter.  If you havent already, the PS noise reduction filter and unsharp mask could reduce the nose more.   Another program called Neat Image (www.neatimage.com ) comes highly recommended too.  I like how the trees ghosted from the long shutter opening.  The lens flare deffinitly adds to the spooky-ness of the picture.   Very nice captrue.', '2004-06-27 02:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(781123, 85210, 14355, '<td valign="top">Very good photo - nice colors, great sky, the teal colored horizon is very neat.  Title needs adjustment - yacht races having more than boat normally.  "FedEx Looses Boat Kit Box - Castaways Freed!"  would be my choice.</td>', 'Very good photo - nice colors, great sky, the teal colored horizon is very neat.  Title needs adjustment - yacht races having more than boat normally.  "FedEx Looses Boat Kit Box - Castaways Freed!"  would be my choice.', '2004-06-27 02:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(781126, 85187, 14355, '<td valign="top">Wonderful panning technique - you caught the car with the flag perfect.  Great colors, nice crop and great choice of photo.</td>', 'Wonderful panning technique - you caught the car with the flag perfect.  Great colors, nice crop and great choice of photo.', '2004-06-27 02:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(781132, 84564, 14355, '<td valign="top">Great action shot with a perfect background.  I could see thsi one on the sports page.  Crop was a little too right on the bottom - you have to get those $300 pair sneakers in the photo.  Nice crips focus and great colors.  Great job.</td>', 'Great action shot with a perfect background.  I could see thsi one on the sports page.  Crop was a little too right on the bottom - you have to get those $300 pair sneakers in the photo.  Nice crips focus and great colors.  Great job.', '2004-06-27 02:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(781137, 84786, 10170, '<td valign="top">What a great statue for a photo.  Like the angle and the nice even lighting.</td>', 'What a great statue for a photo.  Like the angle and the nice even lighting.', '2004-06-27 02:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(781142, 84589, 14355, '<td valign="top">Great subject and a good crisp photo.  Crop seems a little tight.  Something else to consider - not everyone has their monitor optomized for viewing photos.  You uploaded this at 615x640.  I try to keep the hight of my pictures under or at 600 ........ I find that anything taller than 600 makes 95% of the people have to toggle between the top half and bottom half.  If you need to cut your crop - cut the top and spare the width on challenge photos.  Great take.</td>', 'Great subject and a good crisp photo.  Crop seems a little tight.  Something else to consider - not everyone has their monitor optomized for viewing photos.  You uploaded this at 615x640.  I try to keep the hight of my pictures under or at 600 ........ I find that anything taller than 600 makes 95% of the people have to toggle between the top half and bottom half.  If you need to cut your crop - cut the top and spare the width on challenge photos.  Great take.', '2004-06-27 02:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
