(782220, 85336, 3599, '<td valign="top">Obviously I don''t know what your situation was at the time but could you have pulled into that gas station and gotten a head-on angle of the damage?  Just thought of an alternative to this.  Also, the title is a bit on the long side.  How about "Impatience Leads to Collision"?  The reader will get  the other information from the article itself or the caption.  Just a thought.  Good work and and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Obviously I don''t know what your situation was at the time but could you have pulled into that gas station and gotten a head-on angle of the damage?  Just thought of an alternative to this.  Also, the title is a bit on the long side.  How about "Impatience Leads to Collision"?  The reader will get  the other information from the article itself or the caption.  Just a thought.  Good work and and good luck in the challenge.', '2004-06-28 03:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(782241, 85155, 3599, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo, I like the long shadows.  I have one problem about the title.  It is editorialized.  Why you may think it is a beautiful park, the reader may not.  With headlines try to stick to the facts.  Say this photo is for a story about local citizens upset that this park is going to become a golf course.  How about "Proposed Course Location Angers Locals"  The story and caption could tell the reader where the location is.</td>', 'This is a nice photo, I like the long shadows.  I have one problem about the title.  It is editorialized.  Why you may think it is a beautiful park, the reader may not.  With headlines try to stick to the facts.  Say this photo is for a story about local citizens upset that this park is going to become a golf course.  How about "Proposed Course Location Angers Locals"  The story and caption could tell the reader where the location is.', '2004-06-28 03:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(782258, 84626, 10414, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photo!  I love the way the paint is peeling off the wall, against the vibrant colors.  Great shot!!! 9</td>', 'This is a very nice photo!  I love the way the paint is peeling off the wall, against the vibrant colors.  Great shot!!! 9', '2004-06-28 03:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
