(782983, 85268, 12252, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. Should take a ribbon!</td>', 'Very nicely done. Should take a ribbon!', '2004-06-28 15:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(782984, 85055, 12252, '<td valign="top">Ouch! Incredible capture of the moment. One of my Top Three picks for the challenge.</td>', 'Ouch! Incredible capture of the moment. One of my Top Three picks for the challenge.', '2004-06-28 15:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(782987, 84691, 12252, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, I like the lighting, the energy, and the color. 8</td>', 'Nicely done, I like the lighting, the energy, and the color. 8', '2004-06-28 15:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(782992, 85312, 12252, '<td valign="top">A very good shot (did you use a bit of fill flash?) and my only complaint is that in this shot, he doesn''t look like he''s winning anything, as in -- where''s the finish line? But that''s my only complaint. A fine photo. Love his expression, and I like how you cropped the shot.  8</td>', 'A very good shot (did you use a bit of fill flash?) and my only complaint is that in this shot, he doesn''t look like he''s winning anything, as in -- where''s the finish line? But that''s my only complaint. A fine photo. Love his expression, and I like how you cropped the shot.  8', '2004-06-28 15:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(782993, 84815, 12252, '<td valign="top">Gave me a good chuckle. Good shot, a bit dark in the upper left, but nicely done overall. I laughed at the headline but then it wasn''t really a headline, was it? 7</td>', 'Gave me a good chuckle. Good shot, a bit dark in the upper left, but nicely done overall. I laughed at the headline but then it wasn''t really a headline, was it? 7', '2004-06-28 15:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(782998, 85286, 12252, '<td valign="top">The Mayor is right! Good capture of a smoggy moment (or, at least it looks like smog!). Black and white works welll here. 7</td>', 'The Mayor is right! Good capture of a smoggy moment (or, at least it looks like smog!). Black and white works welll here. 7', '2004-06-28 15:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(783005, 85130, 12252, '<td valign="top">I don''t like your headline (as a headline), but I like your photo a lot. I like that you cut off the tops of the bodies of the passers-by, keeping them even more anonymous and generic. The b&amp;W is nice and gritty and the part that''s blown out is fine. Good contrast. I''m thinking the focus is just a bit soft. 7</td>', 'I don''t like your headline (as a headline), but I like your photo a lot. I like that you cut off the tops of the bodies of the passers-by, keeping them even more anonymous and generic. The b&W is nice and gritty and the part that''s blown out is fine. Good contrast. I''m thinking the focus is just a bit soft. 7', '2004-06-28 15:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(783009, 85228, 12252, '<td valign="top">This strikes me as a very good sort of "stock photo" for the article that the headline describes. Nice job, and the B&amp;W works well. 7</td>', 'This strikes me as a very good sort of "stock photo" for the article that the headline describes. Nice job, and the B&W works well. 7', '2004-06-28 15:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(783013, 84319, 12252, '<td valign="top">Yikes! Good capture at just the right moment. 7</td>', 'Yikes! Good capture at just the right moment. 7', '2004-06-28 15:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(783019, 85274, 12252, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, good for the challenge, and I suggest perhaps cropping out some more of the bottom of the picture (maybe an inch or so). The pic is a bit dark, as well, you might try boosting the contrast? But overall you met the challenge well. 7</td>', 'I like this shot, good for the challenge, and I suggest perhaps cropping out some more of the bottom of the picture (maybe an inch or so). The pic is a bit dark, as well, you might try boosting the contrast? But overall you met the challenge well. 7', '2004-06-28 15:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(783022, 84522, 12252, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great shot at just the right moment. Too bad there''s someone behind the main subject because that''s a bit distracting, but still, great job. 7</td>', 'Wow! Great shot at just the right moment. Too bad there''s someone behind the main subject because that''s a bit distracting, but still, great job. 7', '2004-06-28 15:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(783033, 85212, 12252, '<td valign="top">A great shot. The headline needs improving -- this picture doesn''t illustrate "climbing" in any way, but that''s a nit. It DOES capture homelessness very well, particularly with one shoe on, and one shoe off. B&amp;W is perfect with great contrast and nice grain. (Going back to my headline comment -- if he were perched on a stairway or in a stairwell, for example, the picture would match the headline.) 7</td>', 'A great shot. The headline needs improving -- this picture doesn''t illustrate "climbing" in any way, but that''s a nit. It DOES capture homelessness very well, particularly with one shoe on, and one shoe off. B&W is perfect with great contrast and nice grain. (Going back to my headline comment -- if he were perched on a stairway or in a stairwell, for example, the picture would match the headline.) 7', '2004-06-28 15:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(783037, 85080, 12252, '<td valign="top">Not sure how the pic illustrates the headline -- what''s the ray of hope? But...the picture is very good, and what makes it great is the ball stopped in mid-flight in the upper left. Good focus, DOF, etc. I just don''t quite see the connection of this particular headline with this particular picture. 7</td>', 'Not sure how the pic illustrates the headline -- what''s the ray of hope? But...the picture is very good, and what makes it great is the ball stopped in mid-flight in the upper left. Good focus, DOF, etc. I just don''t quite see the connection of this particular headline with this particular picture. 7', '2004-06-28 15:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(783045, 84203, 12252, '<td valign="top">Even ladybugs "do it"? Wow...  Not the greatest headline, but it''ll do I suppose. I like the picture even though I think it was kind of shoehorned into this challenge. 7</td>', 'Even ladybugs "do it"? Wow...  Not the greatest headline, but it''ll do I suppose. I like the picture even though I think it was kind of shoehorned into this challenge. 7', '2004-06-28 15:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(783047, 85016, 12252, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it. Sorry.</td>', 'I don''t get it. Sorry.', '2004-06-28 15:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(783049, 84285, 12252, '<td valign="top">Tasteless.</td>', 'Tasteless.', '2004-06-28 15:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(783057, 84064, 12252, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how this meets the challenge, besides it being a picture with little to keep one''s interest.</td>', 'I don''t see how this meets the challenge, besides it being a picture with little to keep one''s interest.', '2004-06-28 15:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(783060, 84755, 12252, '<td valign="top">Um, I don''t think so. Technically, it''s poorly lit, too. I can''t imagine a newspaper using this shot, so I think it doesn''t meet the challenge.</td>', 'Um, I don''t think so. Technically, it''s poorly lit, too. I can''t imagine a newspaper using this shot, so I think it doesn''t meet the challenge.', '2004-06-28 15:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(783064, 84910, 12252, '<td valign="top">Add me to the list of those who don''t get it. I really don''t get it at all. What''s a clone, in the context of this picture? Sorry, all I see is a lot of grey and some white things near the top.</td>', 'Add me to the list of those who don''t get it. I really don''t get it at all. What''s a clone, in the context of this picture? Sorry, all I see is a lot of grey and some white things near the top.', '2004-06-28 15:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(783070, 84628, 13136, '<td valign="top">Very good picture. Headline needs work.</td>', 'Very good picture. Headline needs work.', '2004-06-28 15:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(783071, 84374, 12252, '<td valign="top">If this was for a newspaper, I would suggeset a better background, better focus, better depth of field, and better lighting.</td>', 'If this was for a newspaper, I would suggeset a better background, better focus, better depth of field, and better lighting.', '2004-06-28 15:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(783079, 84393, 12252, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t work for me. Too bad the sand isn''t in focus. The waves look good. The headline needs something, I''m not sure what. In the center of the picture in the middle of that wave, is that the surfer? If so, he/she''s quite difficult to make out.</td>', 'Doesn''t work for me. Too bad the sand isn''t in focus. The waves look good. The headline needs something, I''m not sure what. In the center of the picture in the middle of that wave, is that the surfer? If so, he/she''s quite difficult to make out.', '2004-06-28 15:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(783084, 85165, 12252, '<td valign="top">Um, no, sorry. Shoehorned entry. Now, show us the DRAGON and you''ve got real NEWS! &lt;g&gt;</td>', 'Um, no, sorry. Shoehorned entry. Now, show us the DRAGON and you''ve got real NEWS! <g>', '2004-06-28 15:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(783086, 84429, 12252, '<td valign="top">Yes, it does. But this picture has way too much negative space, doesn''t show WHAT fire burns, and lacks much visual appeal. It''s just fire.</td>', 'Yes, it does. But this picture has way too much negative space, doesn''t show WHAT fire burns, and lacks much visual appeal. It''s just fire.', '2004-06-28 15:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
