(783097, 84656, 12252, '<td valign="top">Funny. That''s an amazing meteorite that can knock out all the windows and leave the walls intact! Anyway, the image is soft or too blown out. But a clever idea, though...</td>', 'Funny. That''s an amazing meteorite that can knock out all the windows and leave the walls intact! Anyway, the image is soft or too blown out. But a clever idea, though...', '2004-06-28 15:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(783103, 85031, 12252, '<td valign="top">Way too dark; I don''t see the flag (if that''s what it is) enough to know if that''s the winner''s flag or the loser''s flag, I don''t think the siloutette works well in this context, and there''s too much negative space at the top. I would suggest lighting the subjects so we can see their facial expressions...</td>', 'Way too dark; I don''t see the flag (if that''s what it is) enough to know if that''s the winner''s flag or the loser''s flag, I don''t think the siloutette works well in this context, and there''s too much negative space at the top. I would suggest lighting the subjects so we can see their facial expressions...', '2004-06-28 15:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(783109, 84766, 12252, '<td valign="top">This is an odd picture. The background looks like a PS filter was applied? Maybe even to the whole image? The bee isn''t in very good focus and what is he sitting on? What''s the red stuff? All in all, I don''t quite understand this image.</td>', 'This is an odd picture. The background looks like a PS filter was applied? Maybe even to the whole image? The bee isn''t in very good focus and what is he sitting on? What''s the red stuff? All in all, I don''t quite understand this image.', '2004-06-28 15:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(783112, 85214, 12252, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what this image is. An ashtray, I''m guessing, but too much is blurry. What''s the white thing, a cigarette? Sorry, I just can''t make out everything in the image.</td>', 'I''m not sure what this image is. An ashtray, I''m guessing, but too much is blurry. What''s the white thing, a cigarette? Sorry, I just can''t make out everything in the image.', '2004-06-28 15:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(783230, 84944, 22011, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the emotion here quite well, but you''ve cropped/cut out the bit that makes your headline, the flame that I assume is at the top of the alloy tube...  The camera is a litle distracting as well.</td>', 'You''ve captured the emotion here quite well, but you''ve cropped/cut out the bit that makes your headline, the flame that I assume is at the top of the alloy tube...  The camera is a litle distracting as well.', '2004-06-28 17:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(783236, 85318, 22011, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s grainy....  I assume you did this so it''d look like it was in the paper?  I think it might be a little over done if that''s the case.  If it''s your camera delivering this much noise, I think you need a new one :-).  I would have cropped out more of the top of the image, to focus on the cab and the pushbike chap.  The large black window attracts my eye away from the main ''characters'' in this image.<br/> <br/>Having said all that, it''s a much stronger match for the challenge than some of the more asthetically pleasing photos in this comp.  Well done.</td>', 'Wow, that''s grainy....  I assume you did this so it''d look like it was in the paper?  I think it might be a little over done if that''s the case.  If it''s your camera delivering this much noise, I think you need a new one :-).  I would have cropped out more of the top of the image, to focus on the cab and the pushbike chap.  The large black window attracts my eye away from the main ''characters'' in this image. Having said all that, it''s a much stronger match for the challenge than some of the more asthetically pleasing photos in this comp.  Well done.', '2004-06-28 17:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(783242, 84910, 22011, '<td valign="top">Ahhhhh!  I got it...  Rubbish bins on a beach...  Sorry, I had to think about this way too much for it to fit the challenge, but a very interesting idea...</td>', 'Ahhhhh!  I got it...  Rubbish bins on a beach...  Sorry, I had to think about this way too much for it to fit the challenge, but a very interesting idea...', '2004-06-28 17:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
