(783552, 85011, 16488, '<td valign="top">Lovely alliteration in your headline.  How difficult it is to get a crisp shot under the usual circumstances (no flash?) at a performance...and you did capture her face with a beautiful expression!  I think, especially for this challenge, that black and white might have been a better choice than the sepia tone.  Nice example of how to capture the feel of dance.  Luck.</td>', 'Lovely alliteration in your headline.  How difficult it is to get a crisp shot under the usual circumstances (no flash?) at a performance...and you did capture her face with a beautiful expression!  I think, especially for this challenge, that black and white might have been a better choice than the sepia tone.  Nice example of how to capture the feel of dance.  Luck.', '2004-06-28 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(783554, 84698, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!  Wish my local newspaper were so artfully minded....<br/>Like the use of negative space and the colors in this image, not to neglect the use of motion blur in the drop!  Nice headline, too.  Luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nicely done!  Wish my local newspaper were so artfully minded....Like the use of negative space and the colors in this image, not to neglect the use of motion blur in the drop!  Nice headline, too.  Luck in the challenge.', '2004-06-28 19:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
