(783585, 84086, 16488, '<td valign="top">A very expressive and artful photo!  I think the focus and contrast are  too limited for newspaper work, however.  The angle and the fancy plate do justice to the idea of the reader on one side and the child on the other--personally, I think I would have chosen a less elaborate plate to appeal to a wider group of people.   I think this image would work well in a brochure--perhaps your local hunger-awareness group would be grateful for its use?</td>', 'A very expressive and artful photo!  I think the focus and contrast are  too limited for newspaper work, however.  The angle and the fancy plate do justice to the idea of the reader on one side and the child on the other--personally, I think I would have chosen a less elaborate plate to appeal to a wider group of people.   I think this image would work well in a brochure--perhaps your local hunger-awareness group would be grateful for its use?', '2004-06-28 19:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(783591, 84853, 16488, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite "joke" of the challenge!  I don''t usually ROFLOL, but I would if there weren''t so much cat hair down there!  Thanks!</td>', 'This is my favorite "joke" of the challenge!  I don''t usually ROFLOL, but I would if there weren''t so much cat hair down there!  Thanks!', '2004-06-28 19:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
