(784027, 85331, 22480, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and a great touch with the police tape across the tape, but if a photographer was there, there DEFINITELY would be some police/detectives standing around.  Just an idea for next time.  Also, the body looks a little bit too symetrically aligned with the door.  Otherwise, this is a GREAT shot!</td>', 'Nice concept and a great touch with the police tape across the tape, but if a photographer was there, there DEFINITELY would be some police/detectives standing around.  Just an idea for next time.  Also, the body looks a little bit too symetrically aligned with the door.  Otherwise, this is a GREAT shot!', '2004-06-28 23:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
