(784044, 85130, 22480, '<td valign="top">Great photo, perhaps a little bit over-contrasty for a newspaper, but the framing is nice.  I''m not sure that I like your headline though.  It doesn''t really sound like a headline.</td>', 'Great photo, perhaps a little bit over-contrasty for a newspaper, but the framing is nice.  I''m not sure that I like your headline though.  It doesn''t really sound like a headline.', '2004-06-28 23:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
