(784373, 85240, 11410, '<td valign="top">the light is a bit too dazzling, and makes it a bit difficult to see what the supple ladies on the left are doing.</td>', 'the light is a bit too dazzling, and makes it a bit difficult to see what the supple ladies on the left are doing.', '2004-06-29 05:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(784374, 85270, 11410, '<td valign="top">very newsworthy!</td>', 'very newsworthy!', '2004-06-29 05:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(784391, 85230, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but I think a black or white border would look much better than this mucky brown one.</td>', 'Nice shot, but I think a black or white border would look much better than this mucky brown one.', '2004-06-29 06:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(784392, 85234, 2780, '<td valign="top">Good shot, I like the high contrast.</td>', 'Good shot, I like the high contrast.', '2004-06-29 06:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(784393, 85289, 2780, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit soft, a little USM would help sharpen the front glass. Also I''m not really keen on the green colouring. I think adding a little more contrast would also help the image stand out more with greater impact.</td>', 'Looks a bit soft, a little USM would help sharpen the front glass. Also I''m not really keen on the green colouring. I think adding a little more contrast would also help the image stand out more with greater impact.', '2004-06-29 06:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(784395, 85023, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop would look better. There is too much blank space now imo.</td>', 'I think a tighter crop would look better. There is too much blank space now imo.', '2004-06-29 06:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(784396, 85308, 2780, '<td valign="top">Good action shot :) Its a shame the boy on the left is blurred. Perhaps a slightly faster shutter speed would have helped.</td>', 'Good action shot :) Its a shame the boy on the left is blurred. Perhaps a slightly faster shutter speed would have helped.', '2004-06-29 06:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(784398, 84285, 2780, '<td valign="top">lol, weird :P<br/>USM would make this a little sharper, and improved the overall look I think.</td>', 'lol, weird :PUSM would make this a little sharper, and improved the overall look I think.', '2004-06-29 06:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(784400, 85055, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. It''s a shame the ball is half out of the frame but still, good action shot. 7</td>', 'Nice shot. It''s a shame the ball is half out of the frame but still, good action shot. 7', '2004-06-29 06:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(784401, 85268, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. I would have preferred a tighter crop so that I could see more of the action, but the water and sky do add a nice dramatic effect. 9</td>', 'Very cool shot. I would have preferred a tighter crop so that I could see more of the action, but the water and sky do add a nice dramatic effect. 9', '2004-06-29 06:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(784403, 84393, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think the sand in the foreground really detracts from this photo, sorry :(</td>', 'I think the sand in the foreground really detracts from this photo, sorry :(', '2004-06-29 06:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(784404, 84612, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think this would have looked very good in B&amp;W with extra high contrast.</td>', 'I think this would have looked very good in B&W with extra high contrast.', '2004-06-29 06:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(784406, 84715, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Great contrast and DoF, 8</td>', 'Very nice shot. Great contrast and DoF, 8', '2004-06-29 06:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(784409, 85019, 2780, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit over-sharpened due to the jaggies on the diagonal edges. Try using a different resampling method like bicubic to help reduce this.</td>', 'Looks a bit over-sharpened due to the jaggies on the diagonal edges. Try using a different resampling method like bicubic to help reduce this.', '2004-06-29 06:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(784411, 84757, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great shot, 10</td>', 'Great shot, 10', '2004-06-29 06:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(784415, 85290, 2780, '<td valign="top">The sky seems way too over-exposed but it looks like a very tricky situation to expose correctly. Also I think it would be better if the girls'' feet were fully in the shot. The composition seems a bit awkward at the mo.</td>', 'The sky seems way too over-exposed but it looks like a very tricky situation to expose correctly. Also I think it would be better if the girls'' feet were fully in the shot. The composition seems a bit awkward at the mo.', '2004-06-29 06:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(784417, 84786, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot, 8</td>', 'This is a really nice shot, 8', '2004-06-29 06:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(784419, 84589, 2780, '<td valign="top">Looks slightly soft. I think sharpening it would really help. Also it looks like you''ve compressed it too much. I can see artifacts around the roof and trees which are distracting.</td>', 'Looks slightly soft. I think sharpening it would really help. Also it looks like you''ve compressed it too much. I can see artifacts around the roof and trees which are distracting.', '2004-06-29 06:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(784420, 84374, 2780, '<td valign="top">Looks too soft, needs to be sharpened I think.</td>', 'Looks too soft, needs to be sharpened I think.', '2004-06-29 06:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(784421, 84562, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the mist in the background looks really effective. 9</td>', 'Great shot, the mist in the background looks really effective. 9', '2004-06-29 06:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(784422, 85031, 2780, '<td valign="top">woohoo!</td>', 'woohoo!', '2004-06-29 06:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(784425, 85212, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic shot. 10 +favs</td>', 'This is a fantastic shot. 10 +favs', '2004-06-29 06:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(784426, 84679, 2780, '<td valign="top">Looks too washed out to me, I think u need to bump the contrast up.</td>', 'Looks too washed out to me, I think u need to bump the contrast up.', '2004-06-29 06:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(784429, 85339, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think you sharpened this a bit too much. I also think a tighter crop in on the center would look more effective.</td>', 'I think you sharpened this a bit too much. I also think a tighter crop in on the center would look more effective.', '2004-06-29 06:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(784430, 84469, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice shot :) Were you at the front of the stage in the press area or do you have a reeeeeaaaally long zoom? 9</td>', 'Nice shot :) Were you at the front of the stage in the press area or do you have a reeeeeaaaally long zoom? 9', '2004-06-29 06:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(784431, 84522, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like this, full of action and emotion, very nice :) 9</td>', 'I like this, full of action and emotion, very nice :) 9', '2004-06-29 06:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(784433, 84205, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think you should use the full 640px limit to let all the detail be seen more clearly.</td>', 'I think you should use the full 640px limit to let all the detail be seen more clearly.', '2004-06-29 06:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(784434, 84812, 2780, '<td valign="top">Looks way too over-exposed to me. You may have got away with it if it were in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Looks way too over-exposed to me. You may have got away with it if it were in B&W.', '2004-06-29 06:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(784435, 84723, 2780, '<td valign="top">Good shot, I think B&amp;W would have also looked really good, if not better. 7</td>', 'Good shot, I think B&W would have also looked really good, if not better. 7', '2004-06-29 06:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(784436, 85155, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatic lighting and good end result in what looks like a tricky situation to get the right exposure. 7</td>', 'Nice dramatic lighting and good end result in what looks like a tricky situation to get the right exposure. 7', '2004-06-29 06:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(784437, 85282, 2780, '<td valign="top">This looks a bit washed out. Increasing the contrast and a bit of USM would really improve the photo I think. Also, I''m not all that keen on the border.</td>', 'This looks a bit washed out. Increasing the contrast and a bit of USM would really improve the photo I think. Also, I''m not all that keen on the border.', '2004-06-29 06:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(784438, 85002, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really good candid portrait. Is the headline true? 10</td>', 'Really good candid portrait. Is the headline true? 10', '2004-06-29 06:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(784440, 84319, 2780, '<td valign="top">Hehe good shot. Adding a little contrast I think would improve it a lot, and after the challenge some dodge/burn will really work wonders on this shot.</td>', 'Hehe good shot. Adding a little contrast I think would improve it a lot, and after the challenge some dodge/burn will really work wonders on this shot.', '2004-06-29 06:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(784442, 84642, 2780, '<td valign="top">Normally I would say the sky is too washed out but I think that works well in this case. 8</td>', 'Normally I would say the sky is too washed out but I think that works well in this case. 8', '2004-06-29 06:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(784444, 85191, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great shot. 9</td>', 'Great shot. 9', '2004-06-29 06:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(784446, 84618, 20732, '<td valign="top">I think tighter cropping, maybe onto the riders may have made this photo have a bit more impact.</td>', 'I think tighter cropping, maybe onto the riders may have made this photo have a bit more impact.', '2004-06-29 06:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(784447, 84704, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I think this is the thing that looks great centered. I think it loses a bit of impact off to one side. 7</td>', 'Great shot. I think this is the thing that looks great centered. I think it loses a bit of impact off to one side. 7', '2004-06-29 06:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(784448, 84636, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great shot! I think the border being the same colour as the sky is a bit off-putting as it looks like the pole disappears, but still a 10 score.</td>', 'Great shot! I think the border being the same colour as the sky is a bit off-putting as it looks like the pole disappears, but still a 10 score.', '2004-06-29 06:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(784451, 84628, 2780, '<td valign="top">Good dramatic shot. If you use a slight USM it will look better I think. 7</td>', 'Good dramatic shot. If you use a slight USM it will look better I think. 7', '2004-06-29 06:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(784453, 85277, 2780, '<td valign="top">Looks very soft. Using USM will help a lot and really improve the shot.</td>', 'Looks very soft. Using USM will help a lot and really improve the shot.', '2004-06-29 06:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(784455, 85169, 2780, '<td valign="top">Good panning shot, very effective :)</td>', 'Good panning shot, very effective :)', '2004-06-29 06:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(784456, 85011, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. The motion blur actually adds a lot to the photo, as does the negative space. 9</td>', 'Very nice shot. The motion blur actually adds a lot to the photo, as does the negative space. 9', '2004-06-29 06:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(784458, 84992, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think this looks way too busy. I don''t know where I''m supposed to look in the shot. 3</td>', 'I think this looks way too busy. I don''t know where I''m supposed to look in the shot. 3', '2004-06-29 06:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(784459, 85046, 20732, '<td valign="top">I hope that really didn''t happen! Anyway, personally I think that an angle more from the front would have created a more effective shot. Perhaps even from the other side to get rid of some of the empty space (not sure what was on side you were shooting from obviously so that may not have been an option).</td>', 'I hope that really didn''t happen! Anyway, personally I think that an angle more from the front would have created a more effective shot. Perhaps even from the other side to get rid of some of the empty space (not sure what was on side you were shooting from obviously so that may not have been an option).', '2004-06-29 06:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(784461, 84169, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but the whites looks a bit blown out :(</td>', 'Nice composition, but the whites looks a bit blown out :(', '2004-06-29 06:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(784462, 85229, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Good contrasts, lighting, composition, 10</td>', 'Great shot. Good contrasts, lighting, composition, 10', '2004-06-29 06:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(784464, 85211, 20732, '<td valign="top">I think there needs to be a bit more contrast with the people and the background. It''s hard to see definition on some of the faces as they blend into the house behind them.</td>', 'I think there needs to be a bit more contrast with the people and the background. It''s hard to see definition on some of the faces as they blend into the house behind them.', '2004-06-29 06:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(784465, 85329, 2780, '<td valign="top">Looks very soft, but nothing applying USM can''t fix :)</td>', 'Looks very soft, but nothing applying USM can''t fix :)', '2004-06-29 06:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
