(784837, 85292, 11111, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about your title, but wouldn''t you just love to show this to some commenters? Ha. Great shot - color + composition is right on.</td>', 'I''m not sure about your title, but wouldn''t you just love to show this to some commenters? Ha. Great shot - color + composition is right on.', '2004-06-29 13:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(784840, 84786, 11111, '<td valign="top">Hey - this is a great photo. The border''s a little too ''fancy'' for a newspaper, but I get the message. Nice job.</td>', 'Hey - this is a great photo. The border''s a little too ''fancy'' for a newspaper, but I get the message. Nice job.', '2004-06-29 13:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(784841, 85303, 22046, '<td valign="top">I just wanted to comment on this since I rated it lower than I might have if it hadn''t been in this category. I do like the macro image but I don''t think it would find its way into a newspaper so I downgraded the rating based on not fitting in the category. The image itself is okay. I''d like to see a point of interest to focus on to improve the image itself. Perhaps if there were more contrast in the various elements it might catch my eye more. Still I like the color and the shape of the crack.<br/>Ann</td>', 'I just wanted to comment on this since I rated it lower than I might have if it hadn''t been in this category. I do like the macro image but I don''t think it would find its way into a newspaper so I downgraded the rating based on not fitting in the category. The image itself is okay. I''d like to see a point of interest to focus on to improve the image itself. Perhaps if there were more contrast in the various elements it might catch my eye more. Still I like the color and the shape of the crack.Ann', '2004-06-29 13:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(784843, 84285, 11111, '<td valign="top">Great sense of humor - unique! Keep up the clever ideas and keep us laughing. Looks like a little better focus would help.</td>', 'Great sense of humor - unique! Keep up the clever ideas and keep us laughing. Looks like a little better focus would help.', '2004-06-29 13:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
