(785089, 85155, 8860, '<td valign="top">That shot would certainly ruffle feathers in the press - it''s a lovely wood to lose. If this is true then it''s very sad. OK it''s not a car park at least, but it does still do a lot of damage to the local species.<br/> <br/>Photographically, it''s flawed (blown sky) but the shadows are great.</td>', 'That shot would certainly ruffle feathers in the press - it''s a lovely wood to lose. If this is true then it''s very sad. OK it''s not a car park at least, but it does still do a lot of damage to the local species. Photographically, it''s flawed (blown sky) but the shadows are great.', '2004-06-29 16:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(785090, 85018, 23449, '<td valign="top">Queuing up for what? I would have said this is a journalistic shot, but needs more context.</td>', 'Queuing up for what? I would have said this is a journalistic shot, but needs more context.', '2004-06-29 16:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(785098, 84628, 23449, '<td valign="top">Needs a better caption, but I can see this in a paper.</td>', 'Needs a better caption, but I can see this in a paper.', '2004-06-29 16:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
