(785246, 85058, 20853, '<td valign="top">A poor attempt at humor.  I noticed the Montreal Expos hat on the floor.  The headline should be:<br/> <br/>Expos play before empty stadium as remaining three fans stay home and get plastered..</td>', 'A poor attempt at humor.  I noticed the Montreal Expos hat on the floor.  The headline should be: Expos play before empty stadium as remaining three fans stay home and get plastered..', '2004-06-29 18:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
