(785290, 85229, 11843, '<td valign="top">I Really like this photo! It has good composition and tones. I''d have given you more points if he hadn''t been flippin the bird. I simply doubt that any reputable newpaper would use this photo because of that.</td>', 'I Really like this photo! It has good composition and tones. I''d have given you more points if he hadn''t been flippin the bird. I simply doubt that any reputable newpaper would use this photo because of that.', '2004-06-29 18:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(785351, 85307, 16488, '<td valign="top">Very funny!  And what a great expression on the cat!</td>', 'Very funny!  And what a great expression on the cat!', '2004-06-29 19:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(785356, 84692, 16488, '<td valign="top">Decent job of maiking a model appear life-sized.  I think the contrast might be heightened in this a bit and some of the heavy shadows give the illusion away.<br/> <br/>A note of humor, the "Lassie" photo appeared directly after yours in my line-up!  Together the two are just hilarious.</td>', 'Decent job of maiking a model appear life-sized.  I think the contrast might be heightened in this a bit and some of the heavy shadows give the illusion away. A note of humor, the "Lassie" photo appeared directly after yours in my line-up!  Together the two are just hilarious.', '2004-06-29 19:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(785359, 84915, 16488, '<td valign="top">This is a nice subject and title.  I don''t undersatnd why the monitor and its display are so fuzzy, however.  I think, too, that this would be improved with a straight horizon line.</td>', 'This is a nice subject and title.  I don''t undersatnd why the monitor and its display are so fuzzy, however.  I think, too, that this would be improved with a straight horizon line.', '2004-06-29 19:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(785360, 84064, 16488, '<td valign="top">As bug photos go, this is really nice.  For the challenge?  It doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'As bug photos go, this is really nice.  For the challenge?  It doesn''t work for me.', '2004-06-29 19:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(785364, 85240, 16488, '<td valign="top">The photo has merit, but the over brightness really detracts and, for a newspaper, the really needs to be much more contrast.</td>', 'The photo has merit, but the over brightness really detracts and, for a newspaper, the really needs to be much more contrast.', '2004-06-29 19:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(785368, 84656, 16488, '<td valign="top">Well....maybe the meterorite struck, but then I want to see the hole in the roof.  Looks like you''ve got lens flare on the corner of the house as well.</td>', 'Well....maybe the meterorite struck, but then I want to see the hole in the roof.  Looks like you''ve got lens flare on the corner of the house as well.', '2004-06-29 19:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(785373, 85274, 16488, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, high contrast!  Just what a paper needs to print.  Composition seems to suffer from the vertical of the tree and its reflection bisecting the photo, however.</td>', 'Beautiful, high contrast!  Just what a paper needs to print.  Composition seems to suffer from the vertical of the tree and its reflection bisecting the photo, however.', '2004-06-29 19:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(785386, 84758, 15648, '<td valign="top">Great Band and Great Shot. You may have seen my picture of guitarist for Lou Grahmm. If you want to see some concert pictures of David Lee Roth, Prince, Whitesnake, Billy Idol ect. Go check out my webpage at www.webshots.com or email me.<br/> <br/>My user name in webshots is LegatoMuzic<br/> <br/>P.S. I gave you a 8</td>', 'Great Band and Great Shot. You may have seen my picture of guitarist for Lou Grahmm. If you want to see some concert pictures of David Lee Roth, Prince, Whitesnake, Billy Idol ect. Go check out my webpage at www.webshots.com or email me. My user name in webshots is LegatoMuzic P.S. I gave you a 8', '2004-06-29 20:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(785388, 84691, 15648, '<td valign="top">Great Shot. Too Bad that head is in the bottom foreground. I have a few dozen descent rock shots in my webshots webpage. If interested got to www.webshots.com and do a search on my user name LegatoMuzic. I think you might like it. I gave you a 9</td>', 'Great Shot. Too Bad that head is in the bottom foreground. I have a few dozen descent rock shots in my webshots webpage. If interested got to www.webshots.com and do a search on my user name LegatoMuzic. I think you might like it. I gave you a 9', '2004-06-29 20:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
