(785809, 85155, 714, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by taterbug:</b></div><hr/><i> I like the composition of your shot. I feel a little conflicted because I really like the shadows you''ve captured with this light/time of day, but that same light seems over exposed/burnt out in the center. Perhaps you could have waited a little or taken just a little sooner, depending on if it is morning or evening. A difference of maybe 15-30 min. if that, could catch the sun lower behind trees, cutting down on the brightness, yet still catching interesting shadows. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I just want to thank you for your comment.  This really helps when someone gives me a tip and not just a critique.  Thanks so much.  I will try that.</td>', 'Originally posted by taterbug: I like the composition of your shot. I feel a little conflicted because I really like the shadows you''ve captured with this light/time of day, but that same light seems over exposed/burnt out in the center. Perhaps you could have waited a little or taken just a little sooner, depending on if it is morning or evening. A difference of maybe 15-30 min. if that, could catch the sun lower behind trees, cutting down on the brightness, yet still catching interesting shadows.   I just want to thank you for your comment.  This really helps when someone gives me a tip and not just a critique.  Thanks so much.  I will try that.', '2004-06-30 01:05:13.000000', NULL, 0),
