(785893, 85158, 20330, '<td valign="top">Not that anyone will read this..... BUT.. I wasnt driving while taking this, I was sitting in traffic, got out of my car and took the photo standing in the middle of the road. I cropped out the cars on the right because as 1 member noticed, I was using DOF. I wanted the eye to follow the yellow lines from the front of the image to the back and while doing so see the line of cars. Border is Good, Border is Bad.. I never know when to add one, I wish I hadn''t in this photo as it did take away from the yellow lines. I apprecaite all comments and critiques! They truly help :)</td>', 'Not that anyone will read this..... BUT.. I wasnt driving while taking this, I was sitting in traffic, got out of my car and took the photo standing in the middle of the road. I cropped out the cars on the right because as 1 member noticed, I was using DOF. I wanted the eye to follow the yellow lines from the front of the image to the back and while doing so see the line of cars. Border is Good, Border is Bad.. I never know when to add one, I wish I hadn''t in this photo as it did take away from the yellow lines. I apprecaite all comments and critiques! They truly help :)', '2004-06-30 01:30:10.000000', NULL, 0),
