(786332, 85075, 23564, '<td valign="top">I can''t understand why this didn''t get a ribbon. NO. 79? I think people need to get their eyes tested. This pic jumped out at me straight away. The detail is fantastic, I can only assume that the lens flare is what''s putting people off but I feel it adds to the picture, especially given the title.</td>', 'I can''t understand why this didn''t get a ribbon. NO. 79? I think people need to get their eyes tested. This pic jumped out at me straight away. The detail is fantastic, I can only assume that the lens flare is what''s putting people off but I feel it adds to the picture, especially given the title.', '2004-06-30 05:13:06.000000', NULL, 0),
