(786510, 85175, 22432, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by genghis:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice shot, but the headline needs work, dont have one off the top of my head, but this one just doesn''t sound like news.  Good work. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks, English is not my native language... But to be honest this is the first that come to my mind :)</td>', 'Originally posted by genghis: Nice shot, but the headline needs work, dont have one off the top of my head, but this one just doesn''t sound like news.  Good work.  Thanks, English is not my native language... But to be honest this is the first that come to my mind :)', '2004-06-30 08:09:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(786512, 85175, 22432, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by airatic:</b></div><hr/><i> This could have met the challenge if you had put more thought into your headline.  As it is, it''s just a funny snapshot.  Something like: "New Statues at Hyde Park Attract Young Visitors"  Try to think what the article accompanying it might be, or what story you are trying to tell. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>This is superb headline for this shot.</td>', 'Originally posted by airatic: This could have met the challenge if you had put more thought into your headline.  As it is, it''s just a funny snapshot.  Something like: "New Statues at Hyde Park Attract Young Visitors"  Try to think what the article accompanying it might be, or what story you are trying to tell.  This is superb headline for this shot.', '2004-06-30 08:11:39.000000', NULL, 0),
