(786639, 84691, 4493, '<td valign="top">I have a lot of comments about the head being in the shot at the bottom of the frame. I had to make a decission, do I leave it in and deal with comments about it in there, or do I crop it out and deal with comments about too tight a crop. I was in a catch 22 situation, so I decided to leave it in there to give the shot a litte more depth.<br/> <br/>Thanks for all the kind comments and high ranking.<br/> <br/>-danny</td>', 'I have a lot of comments about the head being in the shot at the bottom of the frame. I had to make a decission, do I leave it in and deal with comments about it in there, or do I crop it out and deal with comments about too tight a crop. I was in a catch 22 situation, so I decided to leave it in there to give the shot a litte more depth. Thanks for all the kind comments and high ranking. -danny', '2004-06-30 10:07:15.000000', NULL, 0),
