(788309, 84636, 6521, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by csb:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats on the ribbon ... if I''m incorrect, please forgive me... but how did you accomplish that border while remaining within the rules? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>"Borders: Your submission may include a border, but the border may not contain any text, clip art, photographs, or other artwork."<br/> <br/>I don´t see that my border is anything of above. The photo is inside the white line, the rest is just border.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-06-30 21:47:45.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by csb: Congrats on the ribbon ... if I''m incorrect, please forgive me... but how did you accomplish that border while remaining within the rules?   "Borders: Your submission may include a border, but the border may not contain any text, clip art, photographs, or other artwork." I don´t see that my border is anything of above. The photo is inside the white line, the rest is just border.', '2004-06-30 22:39:52.000000', '2004-06-30 22:47:45.000000', 0),
