(790812, 85018, 22538, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jimmyn4:</b></div><hr/><i> Queuing up for what?  Sorry I just don''t understand what this is. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>R: My first "Challenge". I assumed that the photographer''s comments would be visible during the voting process. As it is, the title alone is indeed perhaps even somewhat duller than the colours ... ;-) <br/> <br/>Thanks for all the comments. <br/> <br/>Armin<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-07-01 17:49:59.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by jimmyn4: Queuing up for what?  Sorry I just don''t understand what this is.   R: My first "Challenge". I assumed that the photographer''s comments would be visible during the voting process. As it is, the title alone is indeed perhaps even somewhat duller than the colours ... ;-)  Thanks for all the comments.  Armin', '2004-07-01 18:45:22.000000', '2004-07-01 18:49:59.000000', 0),
(791224, 84636, 2109, '<td valign="top">"Borders: Your submission may include a border, but the border may not contain any text, clip art, photographs, or other artwork."<br/> <br/>Your border appears to have a gradient fill ... do you believe that a gradient is NOT to be considered ''artwork''?<br/> <br/>Again, please forgive me if I''m wrong here... simply provoking thought on rule interpretation, because obviously my definitions and understanding don''t appear to be the same as others.<br/> <br/>--csb</td>', '"Borders: Your submission may include a border, but the border may not contain any text, clip art, photographs, or other artwork." Your border appears to have a gradient fill ... do you believe that a gradient is NOT to be considered ''artwork''? Again, please forgive me if I''m wrong here... simply provoking thought on rule interpretation, because obviously my definitions and understanding don''t appear to be the same as others. --csb', '2004-07-01 21:28:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(791267, 85319, 9913, '<td valign="top">I honestly dont understand how this could have ended up in the top ten!<br/>Nothing personal just my 2kr</td>', 'I honestly dont understand how this could have ended up in the top ten!Nothing personal just my 2kr', '2004-07-01 21:58:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(791376, 84636, 6521, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by csb:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/>Your border appears to have a gradient fill ... do you believe that a gradient is NOT to be considered ''artwork''?<br/>--csb </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You don´t need to excuse yourself CSB, everybody has a right to express there opinion.<br/> <br/>I used gradient tool to get right colors under the photo. I honestly don´t think that i have broken any rules by doing that. I don´t see gradient tool underlay as an artwork, i see Mona Lisa as an artwork :)<br/> <br/>If this border bugs people then i hope that after this challenge site council will make some clear rules what is legal when you create border. The rules today are little bit extensive.<br/> <br/>One is for sure, i will NEVER use border again :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-07-02 00:09:42.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by csb: Your border appears to have a gradient fill ... do you believe that a gradient is NOT to be considered ''artwork''?--csb   You don´t need to excuse yourself CSB, everybody has a right to express there opinion. I used gradient tool to get right colors under the photo. I honestly don´t think that i have broken any rules by doing that. I don´t see gradient tool underlay as an artwork, i see Mona Lisa as an artwork :) If this border bugs people then i hope that after this challenge site council will make some clear rules what is legal when you create border. The rules today are little bit extensive. One is for sure, i will NEVER use border again :)', '2004-07-01 22:55:02.000000', '2004-07-02 01:09:42.000000', 0),
(791631, 85075, 200, '<td valign="top">just so you know...im the one who favorited this. I thought this was an excellent newspaper shot...and a great shot in general. Newspapers would not be put off by the lens flare...i dont think. They would love the raw character here. Another reason you cant take voting too seriously. :)</td>', 'just so you know...im the one who favorited this. I thought this was an excellent newspaper shot...and a great shot in general. Newspapers would not be put off by the lens flare...i dont think. They would love the raw character here. Another reason you cant take voting too seriously. :)', '2004-07-02 01:03:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(792030, 85002, 19196, '<td valign="top">Felicitari pentru aceasta fotografie, mi-a placut foarte mult, nici n-as fi zis ca e o figura de roman (mi se parea mai mult anglosaxon, irlandez poate). Bineinteles, ca de obicei, merita un punctaj mai mare si un loc mai in fata, insa pt. mine conteaza participarea si ideile pe care le poate stimula un astfel de concurs. Numai bine. Ileana</td>', 'Felicitari pentru aceasta fotografie, mi-a placut foarte mult, nici n-as fi zis ca e o figura de roman (mi se parea mai mult anglosaxon, irlandez poate). Bineinteles, ca de obicei, merita un punctaj mai mare si un loc mai in fata, insa pt. mine conteaza participarea si ideile pe care le poate stimula un astfel de concurs. Numai bine. Ileana', '2004-07-02 10:46:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(792727, 84678, 23251, '<td valign="top">I have really enjoyed all the comments made.  As this was my first entry and I had no experience with my camera I was very pleased with the result.<br/> <br/>BTW I knew about the over exposure from the Fluros but for the life of me I could not remove it.  I also stuffed up by resizing and then editing.  Live and learn.<br/> <br/>This is a great site with lots of helpful people !<br/> <br/>Bob</td>', 'I have really enjoyed all the comments made.  As this was my first entry and I had no experience with my camera I was very pleased with the result. BTW I knew about the over exposure from the Fluros but for the life of me I could not remove it.  I also stuffed up by resizing and then editing.  Live and learn. This is a great site with lots of helpful people ! Bob', '2004-07-02 18:27:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(792746, 85212, 13381, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  The cropping really makes the shot -- I love images like this that give me ideas for how to compose photos of my own.  I don''t know if I would have thought of showing just the legs.<br/> <br/>Wonderful job, and congratulations on your ribbon.</td>', 'This is a great shot.  The cropping really makes the shot -- I love images like this that give me ideas for how to compose photos of my own.  I don''t know if I would have thought of showing just the legs. Wonderful job, and congratulations on your ribbon.', '2004-07-02 18:45:54.000000', NULL, 0),
