(805947, 85002, 13602, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the comments and the score.<br/>@Ileana, multumesc pentru aprecieri, cat despre punctaj cred ca am gresit la titlu putzin, fara sa citeasca cineva si povestea titlul nu prea merge cu imaginea. Ai mare drepatte despre concursuri sunt stimulente, mi-ar placea si mie sa fie orientat site-ul putzin mai spre alt gen de fotografie dar asta e :))</td>', 'Thank you all for the comments and the score.@Ileana, multumesc pentru aprecieri, cat despre punctaj cred ca am gresit la titlu putzin, fara sa citeasca cineva si povestea titlul nu prea merge cu imaginea. Ai mare drepatte despre concursuri sunt stimulente, mi-ar placea si mie sa fie orientat site-ul putzin mai spre alt gen de fotografie dar asta e :))', '2004-07-11 13:24:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(811740, 85016, 22922, '<td valign="top">I actually sent a PM to everyone, but posting here to explain.  There were indeed many people who didn''t understand the point of the image.  The image is supposed to show the things people give up to own a luxury vehicle.  Several people said the items along the wall were out of place, but that was the point.  The dingy wall and life-junk contrast with the gleam of the Mercedes hood and the reflection of the ornament on the wall.  Clearly it worked alot better in my head than for everyone here.  It was well recieved by the paper here, so I don''t mind the low standing :)</td>', 'I actually sent a PM to everyone, but posting here to explain.  There were indeed many people who didn''t understand the point of the image.  The image is supposed to show the things people give up to own a luxury vehicle.  Several people said the items along the wall were out of place, but that was the point.  The dingy wall and life-junk contrast with the gleam of the Mercedes hood and the reflection of the ornament on the wall.  Clearly it worked alot better in my head than for everyone here.  It was well recieved by the paper here, so I don''t mind the low standing :)', '2004-07-14 18:21:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(812810, 84757, 8759, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by frumoaznicul:</b></div><hr/><i> Bravo! Bine-ai venit pe DPC, bafta in continuare! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Well done and congrats on your strong finish. Bine ai venit! <br/>Tibi</td>', 'Originally posted by frumoaznicul: Bravo! Bine-ai venit pe DPC, bafta in continuare!  Well done and congrats on your strong finish. Bine ai venit! Tibi', '2004-07-15 12:18:51.000000', NULL, 0),
