(828259, 85319, 332, '<td valign="top">I agree with Nazgul. This would never be published in a newspaper. Firework pictures have to be extra good to make it to the newspapers. You have to have people in them or show some buldings at least.</td>', 'I agree with Nazgul. This would never be published in a newspaper. Firework pictures have to be extra good to make it to the newspapers. You have to have people in them or show some buldings at least.', '2004-07-27 21:14:57.000000', NULL, 0),
