(906572, 84636, 25827, '<td valign="top">I dont know if you still get the comments since this shot has been posted well before I started coming to this site, but this is an incredible photograph. I have been a track and field fan for a long time. You do a great job of capturing it. I hope to see more!</td>', 'I dont know if you still get the comments since this shot has been posted well before I started coming to this site, but this is an incredible photograph. I have been a track and field fan for a long time. You do a great job of capturing it. I hope to see more!', '2004-09-13 00:21:43.000000', NULL, 0),
