(960263, 85240, 12896, '<td valign="top">This was actually an action shot.  I was on the right side of the back stage shooting pics durring the dance in between the curtains so I couldnt be seen by the audience.  My mother owns a dance studio and this was one of their performances.  Their is fog on the stage creating some of that light affect but I do regret turning the contrast as high and thus creating too much light.</td>', 'This was actually an action shot.  I was on the right side of the back stage shooting pics durring the dance in between the curtains so I couldnt be seen by the audience.  My mother owns a dance studio and this was one of their performances.  Their is fog on the stage creating some of that light affect but I do regret turning the contrast as high and thus creating too much light.', '2004-10-15 01:44:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(983977, 84626, 3724, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=37204" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/136/thumb/37204.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/136/thumb/37204.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/136/thumb/37204.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>........here is another version. I love these images of the bumper cars.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-01 18:18:32.</i></td>', '  ........here is another version. I love these images of the bumper cars.', '2004-11-01 18:10:53.000000', '2004-11-01 18:18:32.000000', 0),
