(1420109, 84688, 36628, '<td valign="top">Another great one! I went to take pictures up at queen anne one day and got so confused as to what a giant green frog (it looked like a frog at least) was doing up on top of the space needle. Not to mention that it didn''t make the skyline come out very well. Finally I know the truth!</td>', 'Another great one! I went to take pictures up at queen anne one day and got so confused as to what a giant green frog (it looked like a frog at least) was doing up on top of the space needle. Not to mention that it didn''t make the skyline come out very well. Finally I know the truth!', '2005-05-30 02:50:02.000000', NULL, 0),
