(1558084, 85327, 37893, '<td valign="top">Great lines against the old building in the background. Again this is where a bit of PS magic can help against parallax. The building almost seems to tip over. A circular polarizer would have been great for this image as well. It brings out the drama of a blue sky.</td>', 'Great lines against the old building in the background. Again this is where a bit of PS magic can help against parallax. The building almost seems to tip over. A circular polarizer would have been great for this image as well. It brings out the drama of a blue sky.', '2005-07-24 00:20:26.000000', NULL, 0),
